<l3.>vyākhyānāvasāne kaiyaṭena uttarapadamuttarapadaśabdenocyate bhīmo bhīmasena itivat| ekadeśena samudāyagrahaṇasaṃbhavāt tenottarapadasya padatve padavyapadeśe kartavye pratyayalakṣaṇaṃ  na bhavatītyartha 
<l4.> iti vyākhyānatvena padasya buddhistatvāt eveṃ(vaṃ) siddhe yatpadagrahaṇaṃ kriyate tenaitat jñāpyate padādiśabdoccāraṇapūrvaka eva vidhiḥ padādividhiśabdena vivakṣita iti tena ṇatvavidherapadādividhitvāt 
<l5.> pratyayalakṣaṇapratiṣedhāt druṇasādiṣu aṭkupvāṅiti ṇatvasya siddhatvamiti na caivaṃ pūrvoktabhāṣyasandarbhavirodha iti vācyam uttarapadādiśabdoccāraṇapūrvakatve'pi tasya svaravidheḥ vastutaḥ padādi
<l6.>vidhitvābhāvāt vastutaḥ padādividhitvābhāvāt vastutaḥ padādividhitvasyāpi vivakṣāmabhipretyaiva pūrvoktabhāṣyasandarbhapravṛtteḥ tasmāt pūrvapadāditi sūtraṃ nayamārthameveti nārāyaṇaśabdasya yaugikatve ṇatvaṃ na sidhyatīti 
<l7.> vayaṃ tu brūmaḥ vastutaḥ padādividhireva padādividhiśabdena vivakṣitaḥ lāghavāt na tu padādiśabdoccāraṇapūrvakatvamapi vivakṣaṇīyam| gauravānmānābhāvācca apadādividhāvityatra padagrahaṇaṃ tu spaṣṭārthameva mātrā
