<p11b., F9a., l1.> tāni yogavibhāgenaivānena nivāritāni tathā ca dṛṇasenetyādāvajādau vibhaktau parata uttarapadasya padatvābhāvāt ṇatvasiddhāvapi dṛṇasābhyāmityādau halādivibhaktau ṇatvaṃ na sidhyatyevetyata āha (–) śrīmān pa(.....)tva
