<l15.> kalpyamityabhiprāyasyāvaśya(-)kalpyatvāt anyadhā(thā) druṇasādiṣu vidhitvopavarṇanasya taiḥ kṛtasya nirālambanatvāpātāt pūrvapadātsaṃjñāyāmaga iti sūtre bhāṣyakṛdādibhirasya sūtrasya 
<l16.> vidhya atvamupavarṇitam| tatra tadupavarṇanaparabhāṣyakaiyaṭagranthasandarbhaṃ yaccodyamāṣṭamikabhāṣyandharī viruddheti ślokāvataraṇāvasare spaṣṭamupapādayiṣyāmaḥ| tatsūtravṛttāvapi apire tu 

<p12b., F10a., l1.> pūrvasū(.......)nameva yannityaṃ tatsamānapadamiti samānagrahaṇādāśrayanti teṣāmaprāptameva ṇatvamanena vidhīyate samāse hi pūrvottarapadavibhāgādasamānapadatvamastītyuktam| vivṛtaścāyaṃ grantho haradattamiśraiḥ apare tvityādi
<l2.>(.......)naḥ samānamevetyavayavadhāraṇaṃ labhyate| ata āha samānagrahaṇāditi pada ityeva vaktavyaṃ tatrāpadāsthayornimittanimittinorabhāvāt padagrahaṇamekatvavivakṣārthaṃ vijñāyate evaṃ siddhe yat samānagrahaṇaṃ kriyate tasyai tat 
<l3.> prayojanaṃ yathaivaṃ vijñāyeta samānameva yat padamiti teṣāmevaṃ bruvatāṃ vidhyarthamidaṃ vijñāyata ityāha teṣāmiti vidhyarthatvamevopapādayati samāse hīti tathā ca śaṅkarayānādiśabdānāṃ kṣubhnāditvakalpanaṃ 
<l4.> bhāṣyakṛdādīnāmapi sammatameva tasmādvastutaḥ padādividhireva padādividhiśabdena vivakṣita iti| nanvevaṃ sati vanaṃ puraketyādisūtrairvanāṅganvāhanapānādiśabdānāmuttarapadalatānāṃ ṇatvavidhirvyatyasyāt (................vakādi) śabdeṣu ṇatva
<l5.>vidheḥ padādividhitvābhāvena uttarapadatve ceti vārtikapravṛtyā aṭkupvāṅiti sūtreṇaiva ṇatvasiddhatvādityata āha||14||

ṇatvādhikāragatasūtra(.....)rī virodhacodyāni vā gatināsmadudīritārthe (–) sidhyavatāniyamatatparatāvibhāge 
<l6.> śītāṃśukhaṇḍadharaśikṣitamānasānām ayamāśayaḥ| vanaṃ puraketisūtraṃ tāvanniyamārtham| sadasi patravanamityādau etvasyāvyaktatvamityubhayavādisiddhaṃ paraṃ tu purakāvaṇamityatra saṃjñāśabdatvena tvanmate pūrvapadādisūtrasya vidhyarthatve 
<l7.> tenaiva sūtreṇa etvaṃ siddhaṃ tasya niyamārthatve aṭkupvāṅiti sūtreṇa| manmate kṛtasya viddharthatva(vidhyarthatve) naiya(naña)rthatve'pi aṭkupvāṅiti pūrvapadāditi ca dvayoḥ prāptau paratvāt pūrvapadāditi sūtreṇaiveti viśeṣaḥ na ca pūrva
<l8.>padatvādityasyāsiddhatvāt aṭkupvāṅityeva tatra ṇatvaṃ vaktavyamiti kathamevamuktamiti vācyam| yoge yogo kā siddhaḥ kiṃ tu prakaraṇe prakaraṇamiti pakṣamārutyaiva(-)mabhidhānāt| syādetat asmin 
<l9.> pakṣe upasargādasamāse'pi ṇopadeśasyetyatrāsamāse'pi grahaṇaṃ jñāpakamiti vaktavyaṃ tathā hi praṇamati māṇavaka ityādau ṇatvasidhyarthametat sūtraṃ tatrāsamāse 
<l10.> grahaṇābhāve pūrvapadādityadhikārāt samāsa eva pūrvapadasya saṃbhavāt samāsa evāsya sūtrasya pravṛttiriti vijñāyeta tadadhikāravṛttisūcakārthamasamāse'pi grahaṇaṃ 
<l11.> tatra upasargādityatra yadi pūrvapadādhikāra(raḥ) syāt| tenaivātrāpi ṇatvaṃ siddhamiti upasargāditi vyarthaṃ syāt| ato nānuvartate tathā cāsamāse prāptyarthakamiti vyākhyānādeva uttarapadādhikā
<l12.>ranivṛttiriti yadyapi vaktuṃ śakyate tathāpi asamāse'pi grahaṇābhāve samāse asaṃjñāyāṃ pramāṇā ka ityādau ṇatvaṃ na syāt| pūrvapadāt saṃjñāyāmiti niyamādasya sūtrasya cāsamāse praṇamatītyādau 
<l13.> caritārthatvāt sati asamāse'pi grahaṇe samāse asaṃjñāyāmapi ṇatvaṃ sidhyati saṃjñāyāṃ tu aṭkupvāṅityeva siddham||16(?)||
 
yoge yogo siddha(ddhaḥ) syāt tadā pūrvapadāditi sūtraṃ prati 
<l14.> upasargāditi sūtrasyāsiddhatvena tena tasya niyantumaśakyatvāt asamāse'pi grahaṇābhāve'pi samāse saṃjñāyāmapi ṇatvasidhyā tadvyarthaṃ syāt iti prakaraṇe prakaraṇamasiddhaṃ na tu yoge yoga ityanena jñāpyate| 
<l15.> etacca tvanmatena saṃbhavatīti pūrvapadāditi sūtrasya niyamārthatvābhāvāt ata eva haradattamiśrairetatsarvamupapādya pūrvapadāditi sūtrasya niyamārthatva evedaṃ vidhyarthatve tu naitadupapādyata 

<p13a., F10b., l1.> ityuktamiti cet atrocyate manmate asamāse'pi grahaṇasya jñāpakatvāsambhave'pi stautiṇyorevaṣaṇyabhyāsāditi sūtre sisikṣati susūṣata ityādau abhyāsāduttarasya sasya ṣatvanivāraṇārthe 
<l2.> abhyāsāditi grahaṇaṃ jñāpakaṃ saṃbhavatyeva tathā hi tatrābhyāsādityasyābhāve abhiṣiṣikṣatītyādau sthādiṣvabhyāsena cābhyāsasyetyupasargādyā 
<l3.> prāpitaḥ sāpi niyamena niṣidhyeta satī tu tasminnabhyāsādyā prāpitaḥ saiva niṣidhyata iti abhiṣiṣikṣatītyādi sidhyati idaṃ ca prayojanaṃ yoge yogasyāsiddhatve 
<l4.> na ghaṭate| stautiṇyoreveti niyamaṃ prati sthādiṣvityāderasiddhatvenopasarganimittakaprāpterniṣedhāyogāt na ca pratiṣiṣati atha ṣiṣatītyādi
<l5.>vṛttikṛduktameva tatra pratyudāharaṇamastu abhyāsādityasyābhāve tatra dhātunimittakaprāpterapi niṣedhāpatteriti vācyam| niyamasya tulyajātīyā 
<l6.> pakṣatve na bhūte sani parato yo dhātustasya yā ṣatvaprāpti

(ptiḥ) sa tasyā eva niṣedha ityabhyupagamyāpi pratiṣiṣatītyādāvanupapattivāraṇa
<l7.>saṃbhavāt sa nītiviṣayasaptamīmāśritya sani kṛte yā ṣatvaprāptiḥ saiva niṣidhyata ityaṅgīkṛtya pratiṣiṣatyādāvanupapattimudghāṭyābhyāsādityanena tadvāraṇaṃ tu prakṣā
<l8.>lanāddhiti nyāyamanusarati evaṃ sthādiṣviti sūtre abhyāsasyeti grahaṇaṃ ca jñāpakaṃ bhavati taddhi sthādiṣvevābhyāsasya upasargāditi sūtreṇa ṣatvaṃ nānyatra abhisusūṣati abhisisī
<l9.>ṣatītyādāvityevaṃ niyamārthaṃ yoge yogasya siddhitve tu etat na ghaṭate sthādiṣviti sūtraṃ prati upasargādityasyāsiddhatvena tena tasya niyantumaśakyatvāt na coktasthaladvaye'pi vacanaprāmā
<l10.>(.......)dyāvadapekṣitaṃ tāvadeva nāsiddhamiti jñāpyate| na tu sāmānyataḥ prakaraṇe prakaraṇamasidhyamiti jñāpyata iti vācyam| evaṃ sati pūrvapadāditi sūtraṃ prati upasargādasamāse'pīti sūtra
<l11.>(.......)ṇasamarthyāt nāsiddhamiti jñāpyata iti vaktuṃ śakyatvenāsamāse'pi grahaṇasamarthyāt prakaraṇamasiddhamiti jñāpyata iti bhāṣyādyukterasaṅgatatvāpatteḥ etat jñāpa

<p13b., F11a., l1.>naprayojanaṃ ca niṣkṛtaṃ niṣpītamityādau ṣatvasiddhiranyathā tatra idudupadhasya cāpratyayasyeti sūtravihitasya satvasyā(-)siddhatvādiṇaḥ ṣa iti ṣatvaṃ na syāt asmin pakṣe sopadādāvityatra 
<l2.> prakṛta eva sakāraḥ namasphuraso(-)rgatyorityādibhiruttaratra sūtrairvidhīyate iṇaḥ ṣa ityatra cāpadādāviti nānuvartate iṇa iti pañcamyā sa iti prathamāyāḥ ṣaṣṭhī prakalpyate| evaṃ ca iṇaḥ ṣa iti sūtreṇaiva 
<l3.> sāmānyata iṇa uttarasya ṣatvaṃ vidhīyata iti āśrayaṇāt yadi tu jñāpakāśrayaṇaṣaṣṭhī prakṛtyāśrayaṇakleśabhiyā iṇaḥ ṣa ityatrāpadādāvityanuvartate tena padādāveva ṣatvaṃ vidhīyate namaspurasorityādyuttara 
<l4.>sūtreṣu sa iti  sa ṣa iti cānuvartate| iṇaḥ ṣa iti sūtre svaritatvaṃ pratijñāyate tathā ca svaritenādhikāra iti sūtre adhikaḥ kāraḥ adhikāra iti vyutpatyā adhikakāryavyutpatyā prāptiphalakasvaritatva
<l5.>pratijñāsāmarthyādriṇa uttarasya visargasya ṣatvameva anyatra satvamevetyarthalābhānniṣkṛtaṃ niṣpītamityādau idudupadhasya cāpratyayasya ityanenaiva ṣatvaṃ vidhīyate ṇa natviṇaḥ ṣa ityanena ye tuge 
<l6.> yogo siddhaḥ na tu prakaraṇe prakaraṇamupasargādasamāsepītyatrāsamāse'pi grahaṇaṃ spaṣṭārthamiti pakṣa āśriyate tadā purakāvaṇamityādāvaṭkupvāṅiti sūtreṇaiva ṇatvaṃ 
<l7.> pakṣadvayamidaṃ bhāṣyapadamañjaryādau spaṣṭamiti bodhyam| tasmāt purakāvaṇamityādau paratvāt pūrvapadāditi sūtreṇa ṇatvamiti vāco yuktirupapannaiva praniranarityādisūtraṃ tu 
<l8.> śarādiśabdebhyaḥ parasya vanaśabdasaṃjñāyāmasaṃjñāyāṃ ca vibhāṣauṣadhivanaspatibhya ityuttarasūtraprāptavikalpāpavādatvena ṇatvavidhyarthamityubhayorapi samānam| pranirantaḥ śabdebhyaḥ 
<l9.> parasyāpi vanaśabdasya saṃjñāyāṃ vanaṃ puraketi pūrvasūtrakṛtaniyamenāprāptameva ṇatvaṃ vidhīyata iti| etadapyubhayoraviśiṣṭam asaṃjñāyāṃ tu tvanmate pūrvapadāditi sūtrasya vidhyarthatve 
<l10.> saṃjñātvābhāvāt tenāprāptaṃ ṇatvaṃ vidhīyate niyamārthatve tanniyamenāpāditaṃ ṇatvaṃ pratiprasūyata iti pakṣadvaye'pi vidhyarthaṃ manmate tasya vidhyarthatvenaiyyatye'pi pravaṇamityādau ṇatva(-)vidhe
<l11.>rapadādividhitvena uttarapadatve ceti vārtikapravṛtyā nimittavat padabhinnapadavṛttitvābhāvena ṇatvasya siddhatvenāsaṃjñāyāṃ pranirantaḥ śabdebhyaḥ parasyaiva ṇatvaṃ na tu rāmavana(-)mityādāviti 
<l12.> tadaṃśe niyamārthamiti viśeṣaḥ| na caikasya sūtrasya kvacidaṃśe vidhyarthatvaṃ kvacidaṃśe niyamārthatvamityetadadṛṣṭacaramiti vācyaṃ kṛttaddhitasamāsāccetyādau kṛttaddhitagrahaṇaṃ vidhyarthaṃ samāsagrahaṇaṃ 
<l13.> niyamārthamityādighaṇṭāghoṣasya sarvavaiyākaraṇaviditatvāt yadvā vanaṃ puraketi pūrvasūtre agre śabdāṃśe saṃjñāyāmiti nānuvartate tathā cāsaṃjñāyāmagrevaṇamityatra tatsūtraṃ 

<p14a., F11b., l1.> vidhyarthamiti hi tava matam ata evāgre śabde tvasaṃjñāyāṃ vidhyarthamityāhuriti haradattaḥ evaṃ ca manmate tatrāṭkupvāṅityeva ṇatvasya siddhatvādasaṃjñāyāṃ vanaśabdasya yadi ṇatvaṃ tarhyagre śabdātparasyaiveti niyamyate 
<l2.> tenāpoditaṃ ṇatvaṃ pranirantaḥ śabdebhyaḥ parasya pratiprasūyata iti bodhyam| vibhāṣauṣadhivanaspatibhya iti sūtraṃ dūrvāvaṇaṃ śirīṣavaṇamityādau vikalpārthamityubhayorapi samam aho dantādityetat 
<l3.> tvanmate pakṣadvaye'pi pūrvavadvidhyarthaṃ manmate tu pūrvāhṇa ityādāvevāhan śabdasya ṇatvaṃ na tu nirahna ityādā(-)vityetadartham| nanvatra nakārāntasyāhan śabdasya ṇa ṣaṣṭhyantasya grahaṇaṃ vā akārāntasyāhnaśabdasya 
<l4.> vyatyayena ṣaṣṭhyantarthaprathamāntasya grahaṇaṃ vā nādyaḥ| ahan(-)śabdasya yadi ṇatvaṃ tarhi adantapūrvapadā(-)duttarapadasyaiveti niyamaparyavasānena dīrghāhniśabde'pi ṇatvaprasaṅgāt na ca vācyamiṣṭāpattiriti tatra 
<l5.> ṇatvavāraṇāya adantādadantasyeti vaktavyamiti vārtikā(-)rambhasya anha(hna) ityadantasya prathamāntasya grahaṇamityāśrayaṇenaiva tatra ṇatvavāraṇasiddhervārtikaṃ vyarthamiti bhāṣyasya darśanāt na dvitīyaḥ| evaṃ sati 
<l6.> adantānha(hna)śabdasya yadi ṇatvaṃ tarhi adantapūrvadāduttarasyaiveti niyamaparyavasānena nakārāntasyāhan(-)śabdasya niyamena nāghrātatvena dīrghānhī(hnī)tyatraiva ṇatvāpatteḥ tadavasthatvāditi cenna 
<l7.> tavāpi pūrva(-)padāditi sūtrasya niyamārthatvapakṣe tulyanyāyatayaitat sūtrasyāpi niyamārthatve(-)naitaddoṣataulyāt tasmādubhābhyāmapyevaṃ samādheyam| prātipadikāntanuṃ 
<l8.> vibhaktiṣu ceti sūtrasthena yuvādīnāṃ pratiṣedho vaktavya iti vārtikena tatra ṇatvapratiṣedha iti na caivamuktavārtikabhāṣyavirodhaprasaṅga iti vācyam| vidhyarthatvaṃ pakṣe tayoḥ pravṛttatvādata 
<l9.> eva niyamārthatvapakṣe etaddoṣavāraṇāya pakṣadvaye'pi prātipadikāntanuṃ vibhaktiṣu ceti sūtraprāptaṇatvavāraṇāya cāvaśyāśrayaṇīyena yuvādipāṭhenaiva vidhyarthatva
<l10.>pakṣe'pi taddoṣavāraṇasiddhau vyatyāśrayaṇena prathamāntādantānha(hna)śabdāśrayaṇakleśo mudhetyabhiprāyeṇa atha vāyuvādiṣu pāṭhaḥ kariṣyata iti bhāṣyakṛta āhuḥ| vāhana
<l11.>māhitādityetat tvanmate pakṣadvaye'pi vidhyarthaṃ manmate tu ikṣuvāhaṇamityādāveva vāhanaśabdasya ṇatvaṃ na tvindravāhanamityādāvityetadarthaṃ pāna deśa ऩtyetat tvanmate pakṣadvaye'pi vidhyarthaṃ manmate tu 
<l12.> kṣīrapāṇā uśīnarā ityādāveva pānaśabdasya ṇatvam| na tu kṣīrapāno bāla ityādau ityetadarthaṃ vā bhāvakaraṇayerityetattu kṣīrapāṇamityādau vikalpārthaṃ paraṃ tu tvanmate pūrvapadāditi 

<p14b., F12a?., l1.> sūtrasya vidhyarthatve niyamārthatve cāprāptameva ṇatvaṃ vikalpyate manmate tu prāptamapi pānaṃ deśe iti pūrvasūtrakṛtaniyamenāpoditaṃ vikalpena pratiprasūyata iti viśeṣaḥ| prātipadikānteti sūtramapi vikalpārthaṃ tatra 
<l2.> tvanmate prātipadākāntāṃśe māṣavāpiṇāvityādau aprāptaṃ ṇatvaṃ nāvibhaktyaṃśe māṣavāpāṇi māṣavāpeṇetyādau mātṛbhogīṇa ityādāviva prāptamityubhayatra vibhāṣā manmate tu sarvatra prāptameva ṇatva
<l3.>miti prāptavibhāṣeti viśeṣaḥ| nanvevaṃ gargāṇāṃ bhaginī gargabhaginītyatra prakṛtasūtreṇa ṇatvavikalpavāraṇāya prātipadikāntasya ṇatve samāsānta(-)grahaṇamasamāsāntapratiṣedhārthamiti vārtikasya samāsa
<l4.>prātipadikāntasyaiva grahaṇamityarthakasyārambho dṛśyate| sa ca tvanmatena yuktaḥ| etat sūtreṇa tatra eva nivāraṇeti aṭkupvāṅiti sūtreṇa nityaṃ ṇatvaprasaṅgena tasya kṣubhnāditvakalpanasyāvaśyaka
<l5.>tayā tata eva tatra ṇatvaprasaktivāraṇe siddhe tatra ṇatvavikalpavāraṇārthavārtikārambhasya vyarthatvāt asmanmate tu tatrāṭkupvāṅiti sūtreṇa ṇatvasyāprasaktyā kṣubhnāditvasyākalpanīyatvena 
<l6.> prakṛtasūtreṇa ṇatvavivalpa(kalpa)vāraṇārthaṃ tadvārtikārambha āvaśyaka eva na ca vācyaṃ tatra ṇatvavikalpe iṣṭāpattiriti gargāṇāṃ bhago gargabhagaḥ so'syāstīti gargabhagiṇītyatraiva mātṛbhogīṇa 
<l7.> ityādivannityaṃ ṇatvaṃ gargāṇā(ṇāṃ) bhaginītyatra tu ṇatvaṃ nāstyeveti bhāṣya eva kaṇṭharaveṇoktatvāt na ca vācyaṃ kṣubhnādipāṭhāṅgīkāreṇa ṇatvavāraṇamiti  gargabhago asyā astīti 
<l8.> vigrahe'pi ṇatvaṃ na syāditi arthaviśeṣaviśiṣṭagargabhaginīśabdasyaiva tatra pāṭhasya kalpanīyatvāditi cenna| pūrvapadasthāt nimittāt parasya prātipadikāntasya prakṛtasūtreṇa 
<l9.> sūtrāntareṇa vā yadi ṇatvaṃ tarhi samāsaprātipadikāntasyaiveti niyamārthaṃ tadvārtikārambheṇa tenaiva niyamena gargabhaginītyādau ṇatvavāraṇasya bhāṣyavārtika
<l10.>kṛdabhipretatvena gargabhaginiśabdasya kṣubhnādipāṭhasyākalpanīyatvāt na ca prakṛtasūtraikavākyatayā vārtikasya vidhyarthatve saṃbhavati niyamārthatvavarṇanamayuktamiti vācyaṃ 
<l11.> pūrvapadādhikāreṇottarapadamākṣipyate| na prātipadikaṃ viśeṣya uttarapadabhūtaprātipadikāntasya nasyeti vyākhyānenaiva gargabhaginītyādau ṇatvavāraṇe siddhe vārtikārambhasya vyarthatvāt 
<l12.> ata eva māṣavāpāṇītyādau namoṅgabhaktatvena samāsaprātipadikāntatayā prātipadikāntagrahaṇenaiva ṇatvasidhyānugrahaṇami(ma)tiricya mānamuttarapadabhūtaprātipadikāntasyeti vyākhyā
<l13.>naṃ sūcayati tathā vyākhyāna eva māṣavāpāṇītyādau numaḥ samāsaprātipadikāntatve'pi uttarapadabhūtavāpaprātipadikāntaviraheṇa nuṃ grahaṇaṃ sārthakamiti vṛttipadamañjaryo sthitaṃ manoramāyā
<l14.>mapi prahiṇvannityādau hi vidhātornumi mo ṇatvasidhyarthatayā nuṃ grahaṇaṃ caritārtha(-)miti vyākhyānaśaraṇamevoktārthāśrayaṇamityuktaṃ tasmāt siddhe satyārambho niyamārtha iti nyāyena prakṛtavārtika(.......māṃ) 
<l15.>duktaniyamārthamevetyaṅgīkāryam| ata eva bhāṣyakṛdbhiḥ pradeśāntareṣu sūkṣmekṣikayā prakārāntareṇa tattadvārtikoktārthamupapādya vārtikāntarāṇi khaṇḍayadbhirapi  sphuṭatarapratīyamānavṛttikāraharadattabhaṭṭojīyatvaprabhṛtigranthakṛdupapāditavaiyarthya(-)mapyetadvārtikaṃ na dūṣitam| tasmāt prakṛtavārtikasyāsmaduktaniyamārthatvaṃ bhāṣyavārtikakṛdabhipretameveti 

<p15a., F12b?., l1.> na ko'pi virodha iti dik| ekājuttarapade ṇaḥ kumati ceti sūtradvayamapi vṛtrahaṇau, kṣīravāṇī, kṣīrapeṇa, vastrayugiṇau, vastrayagāṇi, vastrayugeṇetyādau pūrvavikalpāpavāda ityubhayorapi samaṃ 
<l2.> upasargādasamāsepīti sūtrasamāse praṇamatītyādau vidhyarthameva samāse'pi praṇāmaka ityādāvasaṃjñāyāṃ vidhyarthaṃ paraṃ tu tvanmate pūrvapadādītyasya vidhyarthatve aprāptameva ṇatvaṃ tatra vidhīyate 
<l3.> niyamārthatve tu niyamenāpoditaṃ pratiprasūyate| manmate vidhyarthatvanaiyatyena prakṛte ṇatvavidheḥ padādividhitvena uttarapadatveti vārtikapravṛtyā aprāptameva ṇatvaṃ tatra vidhīyata iti 
<l4.> viśaṣaḥ| saṃjñāyāṃ tu yoge yogo siddha iti pakṣe nāsya sūtrasya prasara iti prakaraṇe prakaraṇamasiddhamiti pakṣe tu paratvādasyaiva sūtrasya prasara ityubhayorapi samam| hinuminā| āni loṭ| 
<l5.> nergada| śeṣe vibhāṣeti sūtracatuṣṭayamapi prahiṇohati, pravavāṇi, praṇigadati, praṇipacatītyādau vidhyarthamityubhayorapi samam| aniteriti sūtraṃ prāṇiṇīṣatītyādau vidhyarthatvaṃ 
<l6.> tvanmate prāṇanamityādāvapi tatprasarati| manmate tu yogāsiddhapakṣe aṭkupvāṅiti siddhatvānna prasarati prakaraṇāsiddhapakṣe paratvāt prasaratīti viśeṣaḥ| anta iti sūtraṃ 
<l7.> he prāṇītyādau padāntasyāpavāda iti spaṣṭameva ubhau sābhyāsasyeti sūtraṃ prāṇīṇiṣatītyādau vidhyarthameva hanteratpūrvasyeti sūtramapi prahaṇyata ityādau sidhyarthaṃ tvanmate 
<l8.> prahaṇanamityādāvapi tatprasarati manmate tu pūrvavat pakṣabhedena na prasarati prasarati ceti viśeṣaḥ| tvorveti sūtraṃ prahaṇvaḥ, prahaṇma ityādau vikalpārtham| antara deśe 
<l9.> ayanaṃ ceti sūtradvayamapi antarhananopadeśaḥ| antarayano deśa iti deśe pratiṣedhārthamityubhayoraviśiṣṭam| chandasṛdavagrahāditi sūtraṃ nṛmaṇādau tvanmate vidhyarthaṃ manmate tu 
<l10.> ṛkārāntāt pūrvapadaḥ syādyadi bhavati tarhyavagṛhya(-)māṇādeva bhavatīti niyamārthaṃ tasmādṛṣābhyāmityārabhya kṣubhnādiṣu cetyevamanteṣu sūtreṣu na kenacidvirodhaḥ| iti 
<l11.> rahasyam| na kiñcidapi sūtraṃ vyarthaṃ nanvevamapi agnimārutamityādau devatā(-)dvandve ceti ubhayapadavṛddhirna syāt tatra uttarapadatve ceti vārtikapravṛtyā uttarapadabhāgasya 
<l12.> padatvābhāvāditi keṣāñcit śaṅkāmanūdya nirasyati|
 
ye tvāgnimārutamukheṣu padeṣu vṛddhe(-)
   rhānirvirodhakṛditi pralla
(la)panti teṣām| 
dīrghācca sūtraparisūcitavṛddhilābha(-)
<l13.>
   ścetaḥ padaṃ na lagati tripurāntakāre||

ayamāśayaḥ| karṇo varṇalakṣaṇādityādau doṣamāśaṅkya vacanāduttarapadādhikāro bhaviṣyatīti bhāṣakṛdbhiruktasya parihārasyātrāpi tulyatvāt na ca 
<l14.> cendavatā dvandve ceti sūtram aindrāgnamityādau ajādāvuttarapade vṛddhiṃ vidhāya caritārthaṃ tatra vṛddhividheḥ padādividhitvena uttarapadatveti vārtikāpravṛtyā uttarabhāgasya padatvānapāyāt 
<l15.> tathā ca sūtraṃ tantra(-)caritārthamiti na ca vacanasāmarthyamiti vācyam aindrāgnaśabde tāvaduttarapadasya vṛddhau satyāmasatyāṃ ca na rūpabhedaḥ| anavarṇāntadevatāvāci pūrvapadakaḥ agniśabdottara
<l16.>padakaśca dvandvo yadi prasiddha(ddhaḥ) syāt tadā tatra rūpabhedaḥ saṃbhāvyate| tādṛśastu dvandvo prasiddhaḥ devatādvandve cetyānando durvāratayā pūrvapadasyānava

<p15b., F13a?., l1.>rṇāntatvāsaṃbhavāt saṃbhave'pi vā tādṛśasya sūktahaviḥ sambandhidevatāvāci dvandvasyāprasiddhireva sūktahavissaṃbandhidevatādvandva evāyaṃ vṛddhividhirityākare uktatvāt āgne bhūmityādau indraśabde (.......) 
<l2.> denendrasya parasyeti pratiṣedhādvṛddheḥ prasaktireva nāsti tasmāt uttarapade vṛddhividhāyasūtrasya cāritārthyāsambhavena āgnimārutamityādau halādāvuttarapada eva sūtrasya pravṛttirvaktavyā 
<l3.> tadā cāpadādividhitvena uttarapadatveti vāmatikapravṛtyā uttarabhāgasya padatvaṃ nāstīti vacanasāmarthyamakṣuṇṇameva| yadi tu ajādyuttarapadakāvṛddhiprayuktarūpabhedavān sūktahaviḥ saṃbandhidevatāvāci
<l4.>kaśca na dvandvaḥ kathañcit prasiddha(ddhaḥ) syāt tathāpi vacanasāmarthyasya tatropakṣīṇatve'pi dīrghācca varuṇasyeti sūtreṇa maitrāvaruṇamityādau vṛddhipratiṣedhāduttarapadā(-)dhikāre uttarapadatve ceti 
<l5.> vārtikaṃ na pravartata iti jñāpyate| anyathā tatsūtramevānarthakaṃ syāt tathā ca vacanāduttarapadādhikāro bhaviṣyatīti bhāṣyametādṛśajñāpakasyāpyupalakṣaṇamiti bodhyam| nanvevamapi rakṣā(-)bhyāmiti 
<l6.> sūtre samānagrahaṇasāmarthyānnityā samānameva yatpadam aśaṇḍamityarthaḥ| parasparavyabhi(-)caritaprayogānarhatvamati yāvat tathā ca nāma nāmetyādau parasparavyabhicaritaprayogārhapadadvayātmakasamudāye(-) 
<l7.>nātiprasaktiḥ pūrvapūrvapadāditi sūtrā tu druṇasādisaṃjñaṃ śabdeṣu vidhyarthameva parasparavyabhicaritaprayogārhapadadvayātmakasamudāya(-)rūpatvena teṣu aṭkupvāṅiti 
<l8.> sūtreṇa ṇatvasyāprāpteḥ itthaṃ ca nimittavat padabhinnapadavṛttitvābhāvarūpasya yuṣmadvivakṣitārthasyābhāvena nārāyaṇaśabde yaugike uktarītyā ṇatvaṃ na sidhyatyeveti 
<l9.> keṣāñcit śaṅkāmanūdya nirasyati| kecit samānapadanirvacanena yogaṃ tvayyantakāntaka nivārayituṃ pravṛttāḥ| nānāvikalpajaṭilaṃ svamataṃ vihāyatepyasmadukta
<l10.>padavīmavaterurevam| parasparavyabhicaritaprayogānarhatvaṃ nāma parasparāsamabhivyāhṛtaprayogānarhatvameva vaktavyam anyādṛśasya vyabhicaritatvasya prakṛte 
<l11.> asaṃbhavāt tacca parasparāsamabhivyāhṛtaprayogārhabhāgadvayātmakasamudāyabhinnatvaṃ vā tādṛśaprātipadikadvayātmakasamudāyabhinnatvaṃ vā tādṛśapadadvayātmakasamudāyabhinnatvaṃ 
<l12.> vā nādyaḥ rāmeṇetyādau ṇatvānupapatteḥ rāmeti prakṛtibhāgasya iteti pratyayabhāgasya ca rāmasya kṛṣṇenetyādau parasparāsamabhivyāhṛtaprayogārhatvena tadarhatvābhāvāt na ca 
<l13.> pārthakyena prayogārhabhāgadvayātmaka(-)samudāyabhinnatvaṃ akhaṇḍatvaṃ pārthakyaṃ cetarāsamabhivyāhṛtatvaṃ rāmeṇetyādau prakṛtipratyayau na pārthakyena 
<l14.> prayogārhau| nāpratyayāprakṛtiḥ prayoktavyā na cāprakṛtiḥ pratyayaḥ prayojya iti nyāyāṃ tathā ca noktadoṣa iti vācyam evaṃ sati rāmanāmani gandharvanagaramityādau ṇatvāpatteḥ tatra subanta
<l15.>samudāyasya pārthakyena prayogārharāmarāmātmakabhāgadvayasamudāyabhinnatvāt na ca pārthakye na prayogārhabhāgadvayātmakasamudāyāghaṭitatvamakhaṇḍatvaṃ tathā ca rāmanāmāni ityādau tādṛśasamu

<p16a., F13b., l1.>dāyaghaṭitenātiprasaṅga iti vācyam evaṃ sati mātṛbhogīṇa ityādau ṇatvaṃ na syāt tādṛśamātṛbhogātmakasamudāyaghaṭitatvāt nāpi dvitīyaḥ| rāmanāmani gandharvanagaramityādau ṇatvāpatteḥ tatra subantasamudāya(.....) 
<l2.>paraspara(-)vyabhicaritaprayogārhaprātipadikadvayātmakasamudāyabhinnatvadhrau(?) syāt ata eva na tṛtīyaḥ rāmanāmani ityādau subantasamudāye tādṛśapadadvayātmakasamudāyabhinnatvasyākṣatatvāt paraṃ tu yadyapi 
<l3.> dvitīye pakṣe saṃbudhyante nārāyaṇaśabde tādṛśaprātipadikadvayātmakasamudāyabhinnatvadhruvau syāt ata eva na tṛtīyaḥ nāma nāmani ityādau subantasamudāye tādṛśapadadvayātmaka(-)samudāyabhinne ṇatvanirābādhameva tritīya
<l4.>pakṣe tu pūrvabhāgasyāntarvartinīṃ vibhaktimāśritya padatvasaṃbhave'pi uttarapadasyottarapadatve ceti vārtikena pratyayalakṣaṇapratiṣedhāt tādṛśapada(-)dvayātmakasamudāyabhinne saṃbudhyante'pi nārāyaṇa
<l5.>śabde ṇatvaniṣpratyūhaṃ śrūyamāṇasubante tu sutarāṃ tathāpi pūrvoktadoṣeṇa pakṣatrayāpi duṣṭameva tathā ca samānagrahaṇasāmarthyāt akhaṇḍaṃ padamiti labhiyata iti vadadbhirapi nimittavat padabhinnapadavṛttitvā
<l6.>bhāvavatvameva nakārasyākhaṇḍapadavṛttitvamityākāmairapi aṅgīkartavyameva na caivamapi pāśabdena prātipadikaṃ lakṣayitvā nimittavat prātipadikabhinnaprātipadikavṛttitvā
<l7.>bhāvavato nakārasyetyartha ucyate tathā ca nārāyaṇatvaṃ na prativartata iti vācyaṃ mukhye saṃbhavati lakṣaṇāyā anyāyyatvāt bharāṇi dharāṇi bhū(?)dharāṇītyādau ṇatvānāpatteśca tatra nimittavat 
<l8.> prātipadikasyaivāprasiddheḥ na ca padāntarasthanimittamādāya nimittaprātipadikaṃ prasidhyatīti vācyaṃ padāntarasthasya nasya nimittatvasyaivāsaṃbhavāt na ca svarūpayogyatvarūpanimittatvaṃ 
<l9.> tasyāpyakṣatamiti vācya evaṃ sati ghaṭenetyādāvapi ṇatvāpatteḥ na ca tatra raṣābhyāṃ paratvābhāvādeva na doṣa iti vācyam evaṃ sati rāmāyāmetetyādau ṇatvāpatteḥ na ca tatra paratvāt 
<l10.> prātipadikāntanuṃvibhaktiṣu ceti vikalpena bādha iti vācyam| tathāpi rāmaṃ kāmeneti vākye nakārasya ṇatvāpatteḥ kiṃ ca yannimittaṃ nimittīkṛtya ṇatvamucyate tasyaiva nimittavat 
<l11.> prātipadiketyatra grahaṇaṃ vaktavyaṃ sannidhānāt tathā ca bharāṇityādau dhātusthameva nimittamiti tadvacaḥ prātipadikasyāprasiddhirapi tadavasthaiva na caivamapi nimittavat padabhinna
<l12.>padavṛttitvābhāvavata ityatra padatvopalakṣitavṛttitvābhāvavata ityartho vivakṣyate tathā ca nārāyaṇaśabde ayataśabdasya uttarapadatve ceti pratiṣedhena tadānīṃ padatvābhāve'pi 
<l13.> padatvopalakṣitatvaṃ vartata eveti ṇatvaṃ na bhavatīti vācyaṃ tathā vivakṣāyāṃ mānābhāvāt upalakṣyā sādhāraṇā(-)nugatopalakṣyatāvacchedakanirūpaṇaṃ vinā upalakṣaṇasyaiva durnirūpatvācca 
<l14.> vastutastu tadā citkatve sati vyāvartakatvamupalakṣaṇatvaṃ prakṛte ca nārāyaṇaśabdāntargatāyanaśabda(-)syottarapadatve ceti pratiṣedhana kadācidapi na padatvamiti kathaṃ padatvaṃ tadupalakṣa
<l15.>ṇaṃ bhavet na ca padaśabdena padasadṛśaṃ vivakṣyate tathā ca nārāyaṇaśabdāntargatāyanaśabdasya padatvā(-)bhāve'pi padasadṛśatvāt na ṇatvaprasaktiriti vācyam asyāmapi vivakṣitāyāṃ mānābhāvāt 
<l16.> sādṛśyasya bhedaghaṭitatvena rāmanāmetyādau ṇatvavidheḥ padādividhitve nottarapadatve ceti vārtikāpravṛttyā uttarabhāgasya padatvena padasadṛśatvābhāvāt ṇatvāpatteśca na ca padasadṛśā
<l17.>nyataradevapadaśabdena vivakṣitaṃ tathā ca na pūrvoktadoṣaḥ| nārāyaṇaśabde ayanaśabdasya padasadṛśatvena rāmanāmādiṣu cottarabhāgasya padatvena ca ṇatvāprasakteriti vācyam| 

<p16b., F14a., l1.> (.......)dharmeṇa sādṛśyasyoktau rāmeṇetyādāvapi pramayatvena nimittavat padabhinnaghaṭādipadasadṛśatvādi napratyayasya ṇatvānupapatteḥ samānānupūrvakatvena taduktau ca mātṛbhogīṇa ityādau (........) 
<l2.> (.....)bhinnabhujagādipārthakabhoginapadasamānupūrvakatvāt bhoginetyuttarabhāgasya ṇatvāpatteḥ samānārthakatvaviśiṣṭasamānānupūrvikatvena taduktau ca nārāyaṇaśabde ṇatvaṃ nirbandhameva nārāyaṇaśabda(.......) 
<l3.>tāyanaśabdasya jahatsvārthāyāṃ vṛttāvanarthakatvenājahatsvārthāyāmapi svārthaviśiṣṭārthāntaropasaṃkrāntatvena nimittavat padabhinnasārthakasvatantrāyanaśabdena sādṛśyābhāvāt na ca padaśabdena padayo
<l4.>gyatvaṃ vivakṣitaṃ tadyogyatvasya ca padāpadasādhāraṇyāt noktadoṣa iti vācyam etādṛśavivakṣāyāṃ mānābhāvāt yogyā sādhāraṇānugatayogyatāvacchedakānirūpaṇe na yogyatvasyāpi durnirūpatvā
<l5.>cca tasmāt padaśabdena pāribhāṣikaṃ suptiṅantameva grāhyamiti nārāyaṇaśabde ṇatvaṃ nirbādhaṃ nanvevamapi samānapada ityatra samānagrahaṇasāmarthyāt asamastā padamityeva labhyate na tu nimittavat padabhinna
<l6.>padavṛttitvam anantānāṃ rāmavanādiśabdānāmarthaviśeṣaviśiṣṭanārāyaṇaśabdasya ca kṣubhnāditvakalpanāpatteḥ tathā ca rāmanāmetyādāviva nārāyaṇaśabde'pi yaugike ṇatvaṃ na sidhyatīti 
<l7.> cenna evaṃ sati samastabhinnaṃ yat padamityarthalābhena rāmanāmanītyādau rāmanāman ityaṃśasya samastatve'pi subantasamudāyasya padasya samastabhinnatvānapāyena ṇatvāpatteḥ na ca 
<l8.> samānagrahaṇasāmarthyādevāsamastamityasya samastaprakṛtibhinnatvamarthaḥ tathā ca noktānupapattiḥ prakṛtiśabdena na ca padasaṃjñālambanabhūtā suptiṅprakṛtireva vivakṣitā upasthi(-)tatvā
<l9.>data eva mātṛbhogīṇa ityādau mātṛbhoga ityaṃśasya samastasya khapratyayaṃ prati prakṛtitve'pi supaṃ prati tathātvābhāvena samastaprasṛtikābhinnatvaṃ vartata eveti na ṇatvānupa(-)
<l10.>pattiriti vācyam evaṃ vadato bhavataḥ ko'bhiprāyaḥ samastaprakṛtikaṃ yat subantaṃ tat bhinnatvāvā samastaprakṛtiko yaḥ sup tadantabhinnatvaṃ vā samastaprakṛtikabhinnasubanta
<l11.>tvaṃ vā samastaprakṛtikaṃ yat subantaṃ tadbhinnasubantatvaṃ vā samastaprakṛtiko yaḥ suptadantabhinnasubantatvaṃ vā samānapadatvaṃ nādyaḥ mātṛ(-)bhogīṇa ityādau ṇatvānāpatteḥ khapratyayaṃ prati samastasya 
<l12.> prakṛtitvāt subantatvācca na dvitīyaḥ| gandharvanagarakalpaṃ gandharvanagarajātīyamityādi taddhitāntasthanakāreṇa tvāpatteḥ tatra na gandharvanagarādiśabdasya kalpabāditaddhitaṃ pratyeva prakṛtitvena supaṃ pratyayaprakṛti
<l13.>marthapakṣadvaye'pi rāmaṃ kāmenetyādau ṇatvāpatteśca na tri(tṛ)tīyaḥ mātṛbhogīṇa ityādau ṇatvānāpatteḥ na caturthaḥ uktadoṣādeva na pañcamaḥ gandharvanagarakalpanādau ṇatvāpatteḥ ukteṣu pañcasvapi pakṣeṣu 
<l14.> priyakaraṇa ityādisamāsasthanakārasya ṇatvānāpatteśca na ca tatra nimittanimittinorekasmin uttarapade saktena na samastaprakṛtikabhinnapadaṃ na tvamuttara(-)padasyākṣatamitītadādāyaṇatvaṃ 
<l15.> sūpapādamiti vācyam| aho bhavato mahānvyāmohaḥ| tatra karaṇa ityuttarabhāgasya samastaprakṛtikabhinnatve'pi uttarapadatve ceti pratiṣedhena padatvābhāvena samasta(-)prakṛtikabhinnapada

<p17a., F14b., l1.>tvarūpasamānapadatvābhāvāt nanu priyakaraṇa ityādau karaṇaśabde ṇatve kṛte anantarameva samāsasaṃjñāpravṛtyā ṇatvaprāptivelāyāmuttarapadatvasyaivābhāvānnoktānupapattiriti vācyaṃ 
<l2.> vibhajyānvākhyānapakṣe priyakara anasu iti sthite samāsasaṃjñānantarameva ṇatvaprāpterata eva pūrvapadātsaṃjñāyāmaga iti sūtre khārapāyaṇaḥ karaṇapriya ityādau asaṃjñāśabde tat 
<l3.> sūtre kṛtaniyamena ṇatvaniṣedhavāraṇāya pūrvapadātsaṃjñāyāmuttarapadagrahaṇaṃ taddhitapūrvapadasthapratiṣedhārthamiti vārtikārabdham| vibhajyānvākhyānapakṣāṅgīkāre karaṇapriya ityādāvapi karaṇa
<l4.>śabde karaṇatve kṛta eva samāsasaṃjñāpravṛtyā samāsasaṃjñātaḥ pūrvaṃ karaṇaśabde pūrvapadatvasyaivābhāvena niyamāpravṛtyā tadvārtikasya pūrvapadasthapratiṣedhārthatvaṃ na syāt na ca vibhajyānvākhyāna
<l5.>pakṣe pramāṇābhāva iti vācyaṃ sautthitriḥ paikṣamāṇirityādau kṛtasandhikāryāt taddhitotpatyarthaṃ kriyamāṇasya samarthānāṃ prathamādveti sūtre samarthagrahaṇasya tatra pramāṇatvāt tathā hi su 
<l6.> utthita iti iñvīkṣamāṇa iñ iti sthite ādivṛddhiḥ paratvāt bhaviṣyatīti aktvarūpanimittasya vināśonmukhatayā akṛtavyūhaparibhāṣayā akassavarṇe dīrgha iti dīrghāpravṛtyā 
<l7.> ādivṛddhau satyāṃ vṛtthi(ddhiḥ) triḥ vātha kṣamāṇiriti syāditi tadvyāvṛtyarthaṃ (................) kriyate etacca vibhajyānvākhyānapakṣa eva ghaṭate anyathā kṛtasya kāryādeva taddhitotpatyā vṛddhidīrghayoḥ 
<l8.> samānakālatvābhāvena niṣparinthino dīrghasya prāgeva taddhitotpatteḥ pravṛttatayā sautthitirityādernirbādhatvena samarthagrahaṇasyaiva vaiphalyāpatteḥ na ca vibhajyānvākhyāna
<l9.>pakṣe'pi antaraṅgatvāt prathamaṃ savarṇadīrghe kṛta eva vṛddhipravṛtyā samarthagrahaṇavaiphalyaṃ tadavasthameveti vācyaṃ yena nāprāptinyāyenākṛtavyūhaparibhāṣāyā antaraṅga
<l10.>paribhāṣābādhakatvasya kaustubhādigrantheṣūdghoṣitatvāt tasmāt priyakaraṇa ityādau ṇatvānupapattirdurvāraiva| na ca padaśabdaḥ samudāyapara iti noktānupapattiriti vācyam| 
<l11.> evaṃ sati rāmaṃ kāmenetyādau ekasmin samudāye samastaprakṛtikabhinne ṇatvāpatteḥ tasmātsarvato bhrāmaṃ bhrāmamapi asmadukta eva samānapadārtho kāmenāpi vaktavyaḥ| evaṃ ca śaṅkarayānādi
<l12.>śabdānāṃ arthaviśeṣaṇaviśiṣṭanārāyaṇaśabdasya ca kṣubhnāditvamagatyā kalpanīyameveti nannevamapyaṣṭamādhyāye pūrvapadāditi sūtrasya niyamārthatvamavāṅgīkṛtya pūrvapadātsaṃjñāyāmuttarapadagrahaṇaṃ 
<l13.> na taddhitapūrvapadasthā pratiṣedhārthamiti vārtikaṃ pūrvapadāditi sūtrasya niyamārthatve khārapāyaṇaḥ karaṇapriya ityādau pratiṣedhābhāvārthakamuttarapadagrahaṇaṃ kartavyamityevamarthakaṃ saṃjñāyāṃ 
<l14.> niyamena pratiṣedhāt niyamapratiṣedha iti vārtikaṃ ca tasyaiva sūtrasya niyamārthatve aga iti pratiṣedhenānantarasyeti nyāyenāniyamasyaiva pratiṣedhāt tathā cāṭkupvāṅiti sūtreṇa 
<l15.> ṛgaya(nādi)śabdeṣu ṇatvaṃ durvāramityetadatvakamārabhyate na tu tatsūtrasyāpūrvasidhyarthatvābhiprāyeṇa| kiñcidapi vārtikamārabhyata ityapūrvavidhyarthakatvasya vārtikakārānabhimatatvena uttarapada(................) 
<l16.> (.......................) vārtikāvalambanena kriyamāṇaṃ ṇatvasamarthanaṃ vārtikāka(kakā)rābhiprāyaviruddhameveti śaṅkamānān kāṃścinnirasyati||17||

kecidyadāṣṭamikavārtikagīrviruddhāviddha(................) 

<p17b., F15a., l1.> pūrvapadeti sūtre| ityāhareta tadapadādipadaprayogamāhātmyabodhavirahaikakṛtaṃ pratīmaḥ| ayamāśayaḥ apūrvavidhyarthatvābhiprāyeṇa kasyacadvārtikasyārambhe'pi paramavācāvityādau kutvādi(............................) 
<l2.> uttarapadatve ca padāntavidhāvityeva vārtike ārambhaṇīye apadādividhāviti vakramārgānusaraṇasya padamadhyavidhāvapi pratiṣedhaprāpaṇadvārā yaugikeṣu nārāyaṇādiśabdeṣu ṇatvasidhyarthatvena pūrvapa(.......................) 
<l3.>sūtre vidhyarthatvasyaiva vārtikakārābhipretatvena niyamārthatvamanāsthāyāṅgīkṛtamityavaśyaṃ vaktavyatvāt| na ca uttarapadatve ca padāntavidhāviti nyāsā(-)śrayaṇe māṣāṇāṃ kumbho māṣakumbhaḥ tasyāpa iti vigrahāśra
<l4.>yaṇe māṣakumbhavāpenatyatra padāntavidhitvābhāvenottarapadatve ceti pratiṣedhāpravṛtyā padavyavāye'pīti ṇatvaniṣedhapravṛtyāpatyā tatra padavyavāyepīti niṣdhāpravṛtyarthatvenāpadādividhāviti 
<l5.> vakramārgānusaraṇamupakṣi(kṣī)ṇaṃ sat yaugikanārāyaṇādiśabdeṣu ṇatvasidhyarthaṃ na saṃbhavati ākaragrantheṣu padavyavāyepītyasya māṣakumbhavāpe netyudāharaṇapradarśanaṃ tu kumbhasya vāpaḥ kumbhavāpaḥ māṣāṇāṃ kumbha
<l6.>vāpa iti vigrahābhiprāyeṇeti padamañjaryādiṣu spaṣṭatvāditi vācyaṃ kumbhasya vāpaṃ prati karmatvāyogena māṣāṇāmityanena sāpekṣatvenāsamarthasya kumbhaśabdasya vāpaśabdena samāsā
<l7.>yogena ca kumbhasya vāpa ityādivigrahāśrayaṇasyaivāyuktatvena māṣāṇāṃ kumbha ityādivigraha evāśrayaṇīyaḥ ata evaitadudāharaṇatulyayogakṣeme caturaṅgayogenetyudāharaṇe 
<l8.> catvāryaṅgāni asya caturaṅgaṃ tena yogamiti vigrahītaṃ manoramāyāmiti māṣakumbhavāpenetyatra padavyavāyepīti niṣedhāpravṛtterākāragrandhāsammatatvena tadarthatayā vakramārgā
<l9.>nusaraṇasyopakṣīṇatvayogāt astu vā kathañcittathopakṣīṇatvaṃ tathāpi saṃjñāyāṃ niyamega(na) pratiṣedhādityādivārtike niyamagrahaṇena niyamapakṣe ityarthakenāpūrvavidhipakṣa
<l10.>syāpi sūcitatvāt anyadhā(thā) niyamārthatvasyāvyabhicaritatvena tadgrahaṇamanarthakagaṃ syāt tasmādasmaduktārtho vārtikakṛtsammata eveti nanvevamapi ṛgayanādiśabdeṣu nityasamāsābhāva
<l11.>padatvasyābhāvasya bhāṣyakṛdbhiḥ kaṇṭhoktyaiva pratipāditatvena tatsamānayogakṣeme yaugikanārāyaṇaśabde nityasamānapadatvopapādanaṃ tadabhiprāyaviruddhameva itthaṃ hyāṣṭamikaṃ bhāṣyaṃ saṃjñāyāṃ 
<l12.> niyame gapratiṣedhānniyamasyāyaṃ pratiṣedho vijñāyeta aga iti tatra ko doṣaḥ tatra ṇatvaprasaṅgaḥ tatra pūrveṇa saṃjñāyāṃ cāsaṃjñāyāṃ ca nityaṃ ṇatvaṃ prāpnoti yogavibhāgāt siddhaṃ yogavibhāgaḥ 
<l13.> kariṣyate pūrvapadātsaṃjñayāṃ tataḥ agaḥ bhāntāt pūrvapadāt tatra yāvati ṇatvaprāptiḥ tasyāḥ sarvasyāḥ pratiṣedhaḥ apratiṣedho vā yathā sarvanāmasaṃjñāyāṃ na vārthaḥ pratiṣedhena ṇatvaṃ kasmānna bhavati 
<l14.> yathā sarvanāmasaṃjñāyāṃ kathaṃ ca sarvanāmasaṃjñāyāṃ uktaṃ sarvanāmasaṃjñāyā nipātanāt ṇatvābhāva iti yathā punaḥ tatra nipātanaṃ kriyate sarvādīni sarvanāmānīti ihedānīṃ kiṃ nipātanamahāpi 
<l15.> nipātanamasti kiṃ arṇagayanādibhya iti naiva vā punaratra pūrveṇa ṇatvaṃ prāpnoti kiṃ kāraṇaṃ samānapadamityucyate na caitatsamānapadaṃ samāse kṛte samānapadaṃ 

<p18a., F15b., l1.> samānapadameva yannityaṃ na caitannityaṃ samānapadaṃ kiṃ vaktavyametat na hi kathamanucyamānaṃ gaṃsyate samānagrahaṇasāmarthyāt yadi hi yat samānaṃ cāsamānaṃ ca tatra syāt samānagrahaṇamanarthakaṃ syāditi| vivṛtaṃ cedaṃ kaiyaṭena samāna
<l2.>padameveti samāse ca pūrvapadottarapadavibhāgāpekṣāyāṃ bhinnapadasthatvamastīti ṇatvāprasaṅgaḥ evaṃ ca vidhyarthametat sūtraṃ niyamārthaṃ atha khārapārāyaṇa ityatra kathaṃ ṇatvaṃ yāvatā kharaśabdasyāpi 
<l3.> padatvamastīti tatsthatvādrephasya samānapadasthatvameva nāsti atrāhuḥ yatra dvayorapi nimittanimittinoḥ samānapadasthatvavyabhicāraḥ tatra ṇatvābhāvaḥ iha tu rephasya vyabhicāre'pi nakārasya samānapadasthatvāvyabhicā
<l4.>rāt ṇatvaṃ pravartate samānagrahaṇeti pada ityeva apadasthayornimittanimittinorasambhavāt sāmarthyāt ekatvavivakṣayā samānatve labdhe samānaśrutiḥ aṅgīkṛtāvadhāraṇārthā vijñāyata ityartha itītyāśaṅkyāṃ 
<l5.> nirasyati| yaccodyamāṣṭamikabhāṣyārthari viruddhā nārāyaṇeti padayojanikā tvayīti| tvatpādabhūṣaṇajhalandhala(ra)rā bhavabhāvadhī vaidhurīkṛtamidaṃ khalu mugdhamauleḥ| tvatpādeti tvatpādābjanūpurabhūtabhujagarājāvatā
<l6.>rasya patañjalimunīndrasya mukhāravindāt nūpurajhalajhalāravavadanāyā senasamudgalanmahābhāṣyarūpo yonirargalopanyāsastatbhāvajñānavaidhuryakṛtamityarthaḥ| ayamāśayaḥ asmaduktābhiprā
<l7.>yakapūrvodāhṛtottarapadatve ca padādividhāviti vārtikaśikṣaṇabhāṣyā(-)bhiprāyāvirodhāyātatryabhāṣyābhiprāyasyānyādaśasyaiva kalpanīyatvāt tathā hi ṛgayanādi
<l8.>śabdasya nipātāṇṇatvavāraṇe'pi ṛṅnagādyādhunikasaṃjñāśabdeṣu aga iti sūtrayatāmācāryāṇāṃ sādhutvenābhimateṣu pūrvapadāditi sūtrasya niyamārthatvapakṣe 
<l9.> aṭkupvāṅiti sūtreṇa ṇatvaṃ durvāramiti manasyāśaṅkya nipātasya sāmānyāpekṣajñāpakatāmāśritya gakārāntapūrvapadāt parasya na ṇatvamityuktadoṣaṃ manasyeva parihṛtya 
<l10.> vastutastu nṛbhir nṝbhirityādau āṣṭamikadvirvacanasya sthāne dvirvacane tvena sthānivatvena samānapadatvāt samānatvābhāvena pūrvapadāditi niyamasyāpravṛtteśca ṇtvaṃ durvāraṃ 
<l11.> tasmāt samānapada ityatra nitya(-)samānapadyamavaśyaṃ vivakṣīṇīyam| tathā ca sūtraṃ vidhyarthaṃ sampannamiti gakārāntapūrvapadānāṃ madhye kecidṛṅnagarādiśabdeṣu ṇatvavidheḥ 
<l12.> padādividhitvenottarapadatve ceti pratiṣedhāpravṛtyā uttarabhāgasyāntarvartinīṃ vibhaktimāśritya padatvena nimittavat padabhinnapadavṛttitvābhāvarūpanityasamānapadasthatvābhāvāt ṇatvaṃ naiva 
<l13.> pravartata ityāśayenāha naiva vā punaratretyādinā atreti aga ityetat vyāvartyatvenābhimitagakārānta(-)pūrvapadakadambakukṣinikṣipteṣu keṣucidṛṅnagarādiśabdeṣvityarthaḥ ṛgayanādi
<l14.>śabdeṣu guṇatvavidherapadādividhitvenottarapadatve ceti pratiṣedhapravṛtyā nimittavat padabhinnapadavṛttitvābhāvarūpamityasamāna(-)padasthatvasatvena ṇatvaṃ durvāraṃ tadvāraṇārthamaga 
<l15.> ityetadarṇagayanādibhya iti nipātanaṃ vā avaśyāśrayaṇīyameveti naiva vedyādibhāṣyapadaga ityetat pratyākhyānaparamityukteruttarapadatve ceti vārtike tacchi(............................) 

<p18b., F16a., l1.> bhāṣye ca jīvatyasaṃbhavagrastatvāt nanu yathāśrutārthaparatvena pratīyamānasya bhāṣyasandarbhasya kusṛṣṭyānyādṛśārthatātparyakalpanaṃ tvāsya dṛṣṭacaramiti cenna bahu(............................) 
<l2.> labdheḥ tathā hi halantyamiti sūtrasthabhāṣye haliti sūtrasthalakārasya itsaṃjñāyāṃ kṛtāyāmādirantyena saheteti halpratyāhārasiddhiḥ tasmin siddhe laṇiti sūtrasthalakārasya haltvasi(................) 
<l3.> va lakārasya haliti sūtre nirdeśena halantyamitītsaṃjñāsiddhirityanyonyāśrayaṃ kaiyaṭenopapāditaṃ manasi nidhāya lakārasyaiva tāvaditsaṃjñā na prāpnotītyāśaṅkya halantyamiti sū(.......................) 
<l4.> cal ceti hall iti samāhāradvandvaṃ kṛtvā saṃyogāntyalopenāntyasya lakārasya lope halantyamiti sidhyati tathā ca lakārasya prathamamitsaṃjñāvidheyā tena haliti pratyāhāra upapadya ityekaṃ 
<l5.> parihāramabhidhāya hasyal hal ityekastatpuruṣaḥ| napuṃsakaliṅagaḥ anyaśca pratyāhāraḥ pulliṅgaḥ ubhayośca napuṃsakamanapuṃsakenetyekaśeṣaḥ tataśca tatpuruṣeṇa halśabdena ha samīpava
<l6.>rtino lakārasya haliti sūtrasthasyetsaṃjñāvidheyā tataśca haliti pratyāhāra upapadyata iti dvitīyaṃ parihāramabhidhāya athavā ḷkārasyaivedaṃ guṇabhūtasya grahaṇaṃ tatropadeśe janu
<l7.>nāsika iditītsaṃjñā bhaviṣyati tri(tṛ)tīyaḥ parihāraḥ| vivṛtaścedaṃ bhāṣyaṃ ka(kai)yyaṭena śaṣasar hal ityatra halantyamityatra ca tavalakāra ityatreva ḷkārasyaikādeśo'lparatvaṃ ca kriyata iti tatro
<l8.>padeśe'janunāsika iditītsaṃjñā bhaviṣyatīti bhāṣyaṃ yathāśrutārthaṃ nopapadyate anyonyāśrayasya tadavasthatvāt tathā hi ḷkārasya satyāmitsaṃjñāyāṃ haliti pratyā
<l9.>hāraḥ sati ca tasmin pratyāhāre (.......) ai aujiti cakārasyetsaṃjñā tasyāṃ ca satyāmajiti pratyāhāraḥ tasmiṃśca pratyāhāre sati ḷkārasyopadeśe'janunāsika iditītsaṃjñā 
<l10.> ityanyonyāśrayaḥ tasmādetat bhāṣyaṃ ḷkārasyetsaṃjñāprāpakapramāṇaparaṃ sat upadeśe'janunāsika iditi pramāṇasyānyonyāśrayabādhitatvāt tatparityajya puṣā
<l11.>dityudādyaḷdita iti ḷkārasyetvena sūtrakāravyapadeśarūpajñāpaka(-)pramāṇaparaṃ paryavasyati evameva hi kayyaṭena| evaṃ tarhi ḷdita iti jñāpakāt ḷkā
<l12.>rasyetsaṃjñā aci kāryaṃ ca bhaviṣyatīti nāstītaretarāśrayatvamiti bhagavato bhāṣyakārasyābhiprāya iti vyākhyātaṃ tatra aiśvaryādiṣāḍguṇyaparipūrṇavāci 
<l13.> bhagavacchabdaprayogeṇa etādṛśabhāṣyokteḥ pramādaleśā ghrāṇasyāpyasaṃbhavena prauḍhyāntaraparatvamevānyāviṣkṛtamevamanekeṣu sthaleṣu bhāṣyatatvavidbhiḥ draṣṭavya
<l14.>miti vistarabhiyoparamyate tasmādatrāpi mahābhāṣyabhakkikānāmapi arthāntaraparatvavarṇanaṃ yuktameveti siddhaṃ vastutastu pūrvoktavārtikaśikṣaṇabhāṣyānurodhenāṣṭamikabhāṣya
<l15.>syābhyupetya vādatvam evamikogu(ṇa)vṛddhisūtre ik(-)grahaṇaṃ kimarthamātsandhyakṣaravyajananivṛtyarthamiti pūrvottarapakṣayoḥ sūtraṃ kimarthamityādanuktvā igrahaṇamiti vadato bhāṣyakṛto bhāsa
<l16.>mānasya guṇavṛddhigrahaṇaṃ vyarthamityāśayasyānurodhena guṇavṛddhigrahaṇe'nuvartamāne punarguṇavṛddhigrahaṇamityuttarabhāṣyasyābhyupetya vādatvamapi sphuṭameva tathā hi e oṅsūtrabhāṣye 
<l17.> khaṭe vandraḥ khaṭe vādakamityādau trimātracaturmātrāṇāṃ sthānināmantaryatastādṛśa(-)guṇavṛddhiprasaṅgamāśaṅkya tapare guṇavṛddhī iti vārtikāvataraṇena vṛddhirādaic adeṅguṇa iti 

<p19a., F16b., l1.> sūtrayoraijendostādapi parastapara iti taparatvena trimātracaturmātrāṇāṃ guṇavṛddhisaṃjñe sta iti parihṛtya yadi tādapi parastaparaḥ ṛdorabitīhaiva syāt yavastavaḥ laḥ ityatra na syāt ityāśaṅkya naiṣa takā(.......) 
<l2.>raḥ kiṃ tarhi dakāra iti parihṛtam etat bhāṣyaphakakikārthaparyālocanāyāntakārasyaiva tatkālagrāhakatvaṃ na dakārasyeti pratīyatetītsvaritabhāṣye tu kirati tiratītyādau ṛta iddhātoriti tvapravṛtyā titsvaramāśaṅkyatīti 
<l3.> pratyayagrahaṇamiti vārtikāvataraṇena pratyayāpatyayoḥ pratyayasyaiva grahaṇamiti paribhāṣāśrayaṇena parihṛtya tato naiṣa doṣa takāraḥ kastarhi dakāra iti ditvamāśritya samādhānāntareṇa vārtikāṃ paribhāṣāṃ ca pratyā
<l4.>khyāya tato dakārāśrayaṇe taparatvābhāvena ṛta āntaryata īkāro dīrgha(rghaḥ)syādityāśaṅkya bhāvyamānatvena savarṇagrāhako neti samādhāyata hyadaso serdādudoma ityatrāpi bhāvyamānatvenokāraḥ savarṇagrāhako na syāt 
<l5.> tataścāmumityādāvevamevotve syātām| na tvamūbhyāmityādāviti paryanuyujyadiva iditi sūtre bhāvyamānasyāpyukārasya taparakaraṇena jñāpakena bhāvyamānopyukāraḥ savarṇagrāhaka iti samādhāya tarhi dyubhiraktubhi
<l6.>rityādau diva iti dyutastit svaraprasaṅgamāśaṅkya naiṣa takāraḥ kastarhi dakāraḥ parihṛtya diva uto daparatve kathaṃ pūrvoktajñāpakatvavāco yuktirityāśaṅkya taparasūtre dakāro'pi cartvabhūto nirdiśyate iti pari
<l7.>hṛtaṃ etat bhāṣyaparyālocanāyāṃ dakārasyāpi tatkāla(-)hakatvapratīteḥ ṛdoranvityatra dakārāśrayaṇe'pi lavaḥ pavaḥ ityādirūpaṃ dussādhameva evaṃ bhāṣyadvayasya parasparavirodhe asañjāta
<l8.>virodhitvena prabalaṃ pūrvabhāṣyamanusṛtya uttarabhāṣyamabhyupetya vāda ityavaśyamaṅgīkāryaṃ yuktaṃ caitat taparasūtre dakārapraśleṣasya niṣprayojanatvāt na caivaṃ diva udityatra daparatvasya 
<l9.> pūrvoktajñāpakatvavarṇanāsaṃbhava iti vācyam| tatrāpi taparatvasyaiva(vā)śrayaṇāt na caivaṃ tatra titsvaraprasaṅgaḥ pratyaya(-)haṇaparibhāṣa eva tadaprasaṅgāt tasmāt titsvarasvaritasūtrabhāṣyasyaivā
<l10.>bhyupetya vādatvaṃ na tve ondhasūtrasthabhāṣyasyeti bodhyaṃ nanvevamapyāṣṭamikabhāṣyānurodhena prāthamikabhāṣyavārtikagrantha evobhyupetya vādaḥ kalpyatāṃ paścāttanabhāṣya
<l11.>svarānurodhena pūrvabhāṣye'bhyupetya vādatvakalpanasyāpi kvaciddarśanāt ata etva yathāsaṅkhyasūtrabhāṣye nāḍīmuṣṭyoścetyatra yathāsaṅkhyamanvayaprapodane'pi nāḍīmuṣṭyo
<l12.>śceti sūtrabhāṣye tatra yathāsaṅkhyābhāvapratipādanāt yathāsaṅkhyasthasūtrabhāṣyaṃ prāptimātrapratipādanamiti nāḍīmuṣṭyoścetyatra manoramāyāmuktaṃ na ca yathāsaṅkhyasūtre 
<l13.> kaustubhe nāḍīmuṣṭisūtrasthabhāṣyameva yathāsaṅkhyasūtrasthabhāṣyavirodhāt cintyaṃ matāntaraparaṃ cetyuktamiti vācyaṃ nāḍindhamaḥ, nāḍindhayaḥ, muṣṭindhamaḥ, muṣṭindhaya ityudāharaṇopanyāsapurassaraṃ pravṛttasya 
<l14.> tatra yathāsaṅkhyābhāvaparasya bhāṣyasya khalagorathādīni trakaḍyaśca yuṣmadasmadoścādeśa ityuttaravārtikārambhadyotyā svaragrastaṃ dhamodheṭo nāḍīmuṣṭyośceti vārtikārthāpanayanamātra
<l15.>pareṇa tatra yathāsaṅkhyaprāptyabhiniveśarahite na yathāsaṅkhyasūtrastha(-)ṣyeṇa cintyatvamatāntaraparatvapratipādasyānucitatvena tanmanoramāgrandha(ntha)syaivājasyāditi cet satyaṃ tatra prāthamikabhāṣyasyāsvarasa
<l16.>grastavārtikā(-)rthāpanamātraparasyānanyathāneyanāḍīmuṣṭisūtrasthabhāṣyeṇāttata(-)vṛttatvopapādanasaṃbhave'pi prakṛte aidaṃparyeṇa pravṛttayoruttarapadatve ceti 
<l17.> vārtikatacchikṣaṇabhāṣyayorasaṃjātavirodhinoranyathānetumaśakyayostātparyarahitena sañjātavirodhinānyadhā(thā)netuṃ śakyenāṣṭamika(-)ṣyeṇābhyupetya vādatvaka(........) 

<p19b., F17a., l1.>yukterevāsaṃbhavāt tasmānneva vā puna(naḥ) sūtredyāṣṭamikabhāṣyasandarbha evābhyupetya vāda ityāśayenāha| pāścātyabhāṣyavacaso bahuṣu sthaleṣu prācīna(................) 
<l2.>dṛṣṭā| prauḍhyā pravṛttiriti samyagabhāṇi śambho bhaṭṭojiyajvabhirato mama ko aparādhaḥ| nanvevamapi bhāṣyakāriyya yathāśrutoktiparyāceṭhā ca nāyanamasādhutvena pratīyamāna(.......................) 
<l3.> etādṛśasṛṣṭimārgeṇa tasya grandha(ntha)tātparyaṃ parikalpya sādhutvasamarthanaṃ kvāpyadṛṣṭacaramiti sāhasāya ta ityata āha| śambho patañjali yathāśrutabhāṣaṇo ndhandhaṃ tat śūḍhabhāvamaha(........) 
<l4.>hu sthaleṣu bhaṭṭojiyajvabhiradarśitaduktarītyā tvayyeṣa yogamahimāpi niraṅkuśo'dya| ayamāśayaḥ etādṛśarīterbhaṭṭojiyajvabhireva bahuṣu sthaleṣu pradarśitatvenādṛṣṭa
<l5.>caramityasyaiva dṛṣṭacaratvāt tathā hi bhrasjoropadhayonyatasyāmiti bhrasjadhātorārdhadhātuke bharṣāgraṣṭetyādau vikalpena ramavidhāyake sūtre bhāṣye bhraṣṭaḥ bhraṣṭavānityatra vaikalpika
<l6.>ramāgamanivāraṇārthaṃ pūrvavipratiṣedhena saṃprasāraṇamiti prathamamuktvā anantaraṃ rasorpāvacanāt siddhamiti vārtikamavatārya sāckare phasya sasya ca vā ṛ bhavati tathā ca saṃprasāraṇṛbhāvayoriti 
<l7.> viśeṣa ityuktvā evamapi luṅi paratvāt sici vṛddhau  kṛtāyā īsa iti rūpasyābhāvena ṛbhāvāprasaktyā abhrākṣīdityeva syāt tasmāt pūrvavipratiṣedhenātra 
<l8.> ṛbhāvo vaktavyaḥ| tathā ca sarvadhā(thā) vayaṃ pūrvavipratiṣedhānna mucyāmahe sūtraṃ ca bhidyate yathā(thā) nyāyasame vāstubhraṣṭa ityādau tu nityatvāt samprasāraṇamiti ṛbhāvapakṣe pūrva
<l9.> vipratiṣedhārambhaḥ sūtradeha iti etāvanmātrameva dūṣaṇamuktam atra ca paramagapakṣe apilliṭi babharjatuḥ babharjaḥ| sani sanivantardhībhrasjadan bhṛbhuśrisvṛyūrṇubharajñapisanā
<l10.>mīti dhvikalpāt bibharkṣati liṅsicostadibharkṣiṣṭa abharkṣa caṅpare ṇau ababhaṅdi(ṅi)tyādayaḥ sādhava iti pratīyate ṛbhāvapakṣe tu apilliṭi babhṛjatuḥ sani bibhṛkṣati halantā
<l11.>cceti sanaḥ kitvāliṅsicoḥ bhṛkṣīṣṭa abhṛṣṭa liṅsicāvātmanepadeṣviti kitvāt caṅpare ṇau abībhrajat irarārāmapavādasya urūdityasya pravṛtteḥ ete sādhava 
<l12.> iti pratīyate| evaṃ caiteṣāṃ babhrajaturityādirūpāṇāmasādhutvaṃ pūrvoktānāṃ babharjaturityādīnāṃ ca sādhutvaṃ yadi bhāṣyakṛtāmabhimataṃ syāt| tadā etatsidhyarthaṃ yatnāntaraṃ kartavyamityapi 
<l13.> ṛbhāvapakṣe dūṣaṇaṃ arthaḥ na ca tat kurvanti tasmāt sūtrakṛtāṃ sādhutvenābhimatānāmapi babharjaturityādināma sādhutvameva bhāṣyakṛdyathāśrutoktiparyālocanayā labhyate| yathottaraṃ 
<l14.> munīnāṃ prāmāṇyāt evaṃ sthite sūtrakṛdaikakaṇṭhyalābhārthaṃ sūtraṃ bhidyata iti bhāṣyasya sūtrakṛdanurodho'tra mayāvaśyamaṅgīkārya iti gūḍhābhisandhimatvaṃ parikalpya yathāśrutoktya
<l15.>pekṣāyā gūḍhābhisandheḥ prābalyamāśritya babhrajaturityādyaniṣṭarūpāpattidūṣaṇasyāpi 
<l16.> bhāṣyakṛdabhipratatvāt babhrajaturityādayaḥ sāvayavaṃ na vaiti matinā ramāyāmuktam evaṃ dvirva

<p20a., F17b., l1.>cane'cīti sūtre bhāṣyadukṣuśabde ca necīti sūtre bhāṣyadukṣuśabde cukṣāvayiṣati uḍurivācarati uḍavati asmāt ṇyantāt sani uḍuḍāvayiṣati tu ru sa tu śamyamaḥ sārvadhātuka iti sūtranirdiṣṭāt tu dhāto ṇyantāt sani kṛtāvayiṣati śvayateḥ ṇau 
<l2.> ca saṃścandoriti ṇau samprasāraṇe śuśāvayiṣatītyādau ṇico dvitvanimittatvābhāvena  dvirvacane'cīti sūtrāpravṛtyā anantaraṃ gatvādvṛddhyā vādeśayoḥ kṛtayoḥ dvitve sanyata ityabhyāse utvaṃ syādityāśaṅkya 
<l3.> oḥ puyaṇijiti sūtre vargapratyāhārajakāragrahaṇāt ṇau ā ca ādeśo dvitve kartavye sthānivat bhavatīti jñāpyata iti cukṣāvayiṣatītyādisiddhiḥ| tathā hi oḥ upayaṇjyapare sani parato 
<l4.> yadaṅgaṃ tadavayavābhyāso varṇatve'syatvaṃ syāt apīpavat, abibhavat, amimavat, adhīyavat, arīravat, alīlavat, ajījavat eṣūdāharaṇeṣu sanvallaghuni caṅ pare'naglope iti sanvadbhāvāditvaṃ 
<l5.> yadyapyatra sarvatrodāharaṇe antaraṅgatvādvṛdhyā vādeśayoḥ kṛtayoḥ ṇaucaṅyupadhāyā hrasva iti hrasvatve sanyata ityevetvaṃ siddhaṃ tathāpi pipaviṣate yiyaviṣatītyetat siddhyarthaṃ oḥ payayo
<l6.>rityetāvadavaśyaṃ sūtri(yi)tavyaṃ tathā hi pūndo(ṅo)yauteśca sani smi pūṅrañjasāśāṃ sani sanivantardhasrasjadanbhuśrīsavṛyūrṇyubharajñapisanāmiti sūtrābhyāṃ vaikalpike iṭi kṛte tadvirvacane'cīti
<l7.>sūtre pravṛtyābhyāse'kārasyābhāverasannyatasya ityasyāpravṛtteḥ evaṃ ca vargapratyāhārajakāragrahaṇaṃ vināpyabibhavadityādirūpasiddhyā tatkriyamāṇamuktārthajñāpaka
<l8.>meveti parihṛtya jñāpasya sajīti yāpekṣatvābhyāsottarakhaṇḍe yatrāvarṇaśrūyate tatraiva sthānivatvaṃ nānyatretyaddivakittat ityādāvativyāptiṃ parihṛtya papatuḥ, tasthatuḥ, 
<l9.> jaghnatuḥ, āṭiṭat, āśiśat, cakraturityādīni sūtraprayojanāni āto lopa iṭi cetyāllopasya gamahanajanakhanasnasāṃ lopaḥ kiṅityanaṅityupadhālopasya ṇeranaṭīti 
<l10.> ṇilopasya ikoyaṇacīti yaṇaśca dvirvacane'cīti niṣedhena dvirvacanasya niṣpratyūhatvādityuktvā dvirvacanaṃ yaṇayavāyā vā lopopadhālopa(-)ṇilopakakito rutvebhya iti ṣaṣṭhe 
<l11.> paṭhiṣyamāṇena pūrvavipratiṣedhavārtikena dadhyatretyādau sāvakāśo yaṇi ca yanaṃ cāyakaḥ lavanaṃ lāvaka ityādau cāyavāyāvaḥ goda ityādāvāllopaḥ śleṣmaghna ityādau vupadhā(-)lopaḥ kāraṇā 
<l12.> ityādau ṇilopaḥ nivṛtta ityādau putratvaṃ ceti etāni nava bindurityādau sāvakāśena dvitvena ca kratuḥ cikāya lulāva, cikayitha, lulavidha, papatuḥ, jaghanatuḥ, āṭiṭat ādigamahanajanaḥ kikinau liṭ ceti 
<l13.> tṛdhātoḥ kipratyaye tatparityādau pūrvaghapratiṣedhena bādhyante ityarthakena ukteṣūdāharaṇeṣu pūrvavipratiṣedhāt prathamameva dvirvacanamiti sūtraṃ vyarthamiti vyākhyāyānantaraṃ 
<l14.> pūrvavipratiṣedhapakṣe padaturityādisiddhāvapi cukṣāvayiṣati, uḍuḍāvayiṣati, tutāvayiṣati, śuśāvayiṣatītyādau antaraṅgatvādatulyabalatvena vipratiṣedhānarhayoḥ vṛddhyā vādeśayoḥ kṛtayoḥ dvitve 
<l15.> sanyata ityabhyāse ikāra śrūyeteti tadvāraṇārthaṃ odaudādeśasyodbhavati caṭu tu śarāderabhyāsasyeti vacanāntaraṃ odautorādeśo yasminnaṅge tasya yo'bhyāsaścuṭutu śarādistasyāta 

<p20b., F18a., l1.> uktthyā(-)tyarthakamārambhaṇīyaṃ na sūtrārambhapakṣe'pi pipaviṣata ityādau itvārthamoḥ puvaṇjityārambhaṇīyaṃ na ca tanmate sannyata iti prakṛtasyaivetvasya viṣayāntarasaṃbandho vidhīyate pūrvavipra(.......)kṣadha 
<l2.> pakṣe kva pūrvamevotvaṃ vidheyamiti gauravamiti vācyaṃ vipratiṣedhapakṣe'pīti ca utparasyātasūtrānantaramodau dādeśasyetyasyārambhāditi cenna pūrvavipratiṣedhapakṣe'pi pipaviṣate 
<l3.> yiyaviṣatītyatra itvārthamoḥ puyaṇajītyasyāvaśyārambhatvāt tathā ca vārtikamate mahatgauravaṃ tasmāt sūtramatameva prabalamiti vyavasthāpitam etat bhāṣyakaṇṭhoktaparyālocanāyām ūnadhāto
<l4.>raṃkadhāto rūḍaśabdācca ṇau caṅi antaraṅgatvāt prathamamato lope caṅiti ṇic(-)sahitasya dvitve auninat, āñcikat, aujiḍhadityādi yaḥ abhyāse ikārasahitāḥ sādhava iti pratīyate tathā hi 
<l5.> abhyāsottarakhaṇḍe yatrāvarṇaśrūyate tatraiva sthānivatvamityuktvā odaudādeśa eva sthānivat nānya iti pratīyate anyatrābhyāsottarakhaṇḍasyāvarṇaparatvāsaṃbhavāt aunanadityādau 
<l6.> cātolopena nāvarṇaparatvaṃ kiṃ caunatadityādau abhyāse akāro yadi sammata(taḥ) syāt tadāntaraṅgatvādato lope niśabdasya dvitvabhāktvena ikārasyākāro vidheya ityapi 
<l7.> dūṣaṇāntaraṃ vārtikakṛtāmupari bhāṣyakṛta udbhāvayeyuḥ| naivamudabhāvayan tasmāt bhāṣyakṛt kaṇṭhyoktyā sāre abhyāse ikārasahitāḥ auninadityādaya eva sādhavaḥ natvau 
<l8.> nadityādayo'bhyāse akārasahitā iti pratīyate pratipāditaṃ caiva melakāhyakāmadhenau voppadevena durgaṭīkāyāṃ durgaguptena kātantrapañcikāyāṃ 
<l9.> trilocanadāsena kātantravistare vardhanamiśreṇa haimavyākaraṇe haimasūtrariṇā śabdānuśāsane abhitavaśākaśaṭāyanena caivaṃ sthite vāmanamādhavādibhiḥ kāśikādhā
<l10.>tuvṛtyādau aujaḍhat, āñcakat ityādau abhyāse akārasyodāhṛtatvena tadanurodhena tatra prayogavelāyāmabhyāsasyāvarṇaparatvābhāve'pi prakriyādaśāyāṃ 
<l11.> tadastītyavarṇaparatvasya vyabhicaritatvena odaudādeśa eva sthānivadityetat jñāpakatvaṃ na saṃbhavati vārtikakṛtāmupari odaudādeśasyetyādi(-)
<l12.>vārtikārambhagauravadūṣaṇodbhavanasyānekadūṣaṇāntaropalakṣaṇatvena aunanadityādāvabhyāse pukāro vidheya iti dūṣaṇamapyudbhāvitaprāyameva tathā hi 
<l13.> vipratiṣedha evātāvadatrāyuktaḥ allopādīnāṃ nityatvāt dvitvatvānityatvenātulyabalatvāt kiṃ ca vipratiṣedhasthale sarvatra vacanāntasyārambhaṇīyatvāt prakṛte 
<l14.> (.......) tatheti lāghavānavakāśaḥ api ca kriyamāṇamāpi pūrvavipratiṣedhavacanaṃ nityānivāntaraṅgānapi bādheta tataśca didivaniyuṣati ninavaniyiṣatītyādau 
<l15.> (.....)se  ikāra śrūyeta tadavanavaśabdena vanaśabdena ca lyuṇimittakaguṇasthānikāvādeśasyāntaraṅgasyāpi dvitvena bādhāt yadi tu odaudādeśasyeti 

<p21a., F18b., l1.> vārtikārambhasāmarthyāt pūrvavipratiṣedhavacanamantyānāmeva bādhakaṃ na tvantaraṅgāṇām anyathā vukṣāvayiṣatītyādāvapi antaraṅgaṃ 
<l2.> vṛddhyādikaṃ vādhitvā dvirvacane abhyāse ukārasya susthatvena odaudādeśasyeti vārtikārambho vṛthaiva syāditi vibhāvyate tarhi 
<l3.> odaudādeśasyeti vacanenaiva didavanipiṣati ninavayiṣatītyādāvabhyāse ukāra syāt abhyāsasya tavargapūrvatvāt tata
<l4.>śca tadvāraṇāya odaudādeśasya cuṭutu śarāderabhyāsasya saniti paṭhitvā yonakenāpyavadhānanyāyena na ṇic bhinnervyavadhā
<l5.>nena bhavatīti samādheyaṃ kiṃ caivaṃ samādhāne'pi tanuśabdāntadācārakvibantāddhetumaṇṇau sati asati vā saniti tanāvayiṣati 
<l6.> titaviṣatītyādāvabhyāsa ukāraśrūyeta ṇijbhinnena ṇyavadhānābhāvāt tataśca tadvāraṇāya odaudādeśasyeti vārtika
<l7.>mevānyathā vyākhyeyaṃ  tadyathā abhyāsasyetvayavaṣaṣṭhī odaudādadeśasyeti saṃbandhasāmānye ṣaṣṭhī ubhayamapyato viśeṣaṇaṃ 
<l8.> tadayamarthaḥ abhyāsasyāvayavabhūtaḥ odaudādeśasya yathāyathamavayavaḥ ādeśo vā yorta tasya udbhavatīti vṛkṣāvadhi
<l9.>ṣatītyādāvayavaḥ pasphārayiṣatītyādā vādeśaḥ atra ci sphurorṇāvityokārasyākāraḥ tasyābhyāsa hrasvastasyo
<l10.>tvaṃ yadyapi haśarapūrvāḥ khaya iti khayaḥ śeṣabhyāsaḥ śarpūrvo na bhavati tathāpyabhyāsasaṃjñāpravṛttavelāyāṃ 
<l11.> śarapūrvatvamasyeveti bodhyaṃ evaṃ dūṣaṇāntarāṇāmavaśyam upalakṣaṇīyatvena tdvadevau na nat aujaddhadityādā
<l12.>vabhyāse akāro vidheya iti dūṣaṇamapyudbhāvitaprāyameveti bhāṣyakṛtāmabhiprāyaḥ parikalpya aunanatyādayaḥ 
<l13.> abhyāse akārasahitā eva sādhavaḥ boppadevādereva mahānpramāda iti kaustubhamanoramayorbhaṭṭojiyajvabhiruktaṃ 
<l14.> evamanyatrāpi vā iṣusthaleṣu dṛśyata iti vistarabhiyoparamyata iti| nanvevamapyuktasthaleṣu bhāṣyakṛtsūtrakṛdaikaka
<l15.>ṇṭhyasūtrasidhyarthaṃ vāmanamādhavādisaṃvādasidhyarthaṃ ca tathā bhāṣyakṛtāmabhiprāyakalpane'pi prakṛte tathā kalpanaṃ nirālambana
<l16.>tvatpādabhaktivirahaikanidānameva| takṣātmajātanayaḥ pāṇiniḥ sarve sarvapadā

<p21b., F19a., l1.>deśādākṣīputrasya pāṇinerityādibhāṣyakārādivyahārāt ayamabhisandhiḥ bhāṣyakṛdaprakhyātottarapadatve ceti vārtikaikakaṇṭhyasidhyarthakūrma(-)rāṇādiṣu vidhiśivayorna(........) 
<l2.>naiḥ sūtasaṃhitāyāṃ yajñavaibhavakhaṇḍe saptaviṃśatrayastṛṃśādhyāyayoḥ paramaśive kevalayogavṛttyā nārāyaṇaśabdo vartata iti kaṇṭhoktyā pratipādayatbhiśca śrīmadvyāsacaraṇaiḥ sa(................) 
<l3.> cāsmaduktabhāṣyakārābhiprāyasyāpyavaśyakalpyatvāt kūrmapurāṇādiṣu vidhiśivayornārāyaṇaśabdaprayogaḥ purastādaṣṭamanavamaślokayorudāhṛtaḥ upariṣṭācca savistaraṃ tamupapādayiṣyāmaḥ 
<l4.> tasmānnava(-)vārtikabhāṣyavirodhaprasaktiḥ vastutastu sādhutvenāsudhutvena ca bhāṣyakārādyabhimateṣu śabdeṣu sādhutvāsādhutvāṃśe vaiparītyaṃ nāsmābhirvarṇyate yena tadvirodho 
<l5.> doṣāvaha syāt paraṃ tu tadabhimatasādhutvāsādhutvāvirodhena upāyāntaramevāsmābhiḥ pratipāditaṃ na caitaddoṣāvaham ata eva mānapūjāyāmiti dhāto(toḥ) svārthe sati mānbadhadānśānbhya 
<l6.> iti sūtreṇa vyutpāditaṃ mīmāṃsāśabdaṃ māṅmāna ityasmāddhātoḥ mīmāṃsāśabdo vyutpanna iti vācaspatimiśroktiṃ samarthayituṃ pravṛ(................)rvaiyākaraṇamūrdhanyai
<l7.>rbhaṭṭojiyajvabhirmānbadheti sūtreṇa nugāgamanipātanapūrvakaṃ māṅdhātoreva san vidhīyate na tu mānadhātoriti vyutpādya tarhi bhāṣyakārādivirodha iti manasyāśaṅkya upeya 
<l8.> pra(................)mapāyā avyavasthitā iti harikārikopaṣṭambhapurassaraṃ vaiyākaraṇānām upāyeṣu nāgraha iti mānbadha iti sūtraṃ manonamāmuktaṃ tathā ca upāyapratipādanāṃ 
<l9.> (.......................)rādivirodho na doṣāvaha iti spaṣṭameva evamastīti co'pṛkta iti sūtre yathāśrutārthamevopavarṇyāsatyādeśabhūdhāto(toḥ) sthānivadbhāvenā(-)stitvamādāya śuddha
<l10.>(.......)ti stheti sijyuki pratyayalakṣaṇena sicaṃ cādāyābhūdityatra īṭprasaṅgaḥ āhi bhuvorīṭ pratiṣedha iti vārtikena astisico'pṛkta iti sūtrabhāṣyapadamañjaryādau 
