<p24b., F22a., l1.>prayogamahimnā caturmukhabrahmaṇi nārāyaṇapadarūḍhigrāhakeṇa caturmukhe'pi nārāyaṇaśabdasya paurāṇikarūḍhe spaṣṭā pratibhānāt na ca kūrmapurāṇe daśamādhyāye tataḥ (.....)masanāsīnaṃ jagannāthaṃ 
<l2.> pitāmahaṃ babhāṣe madhuraṃ vākyaṃ premāviṣṭamanā hariḥ| asmānmayocyamānastvaṃ padmādavatara prabho| tato'vatīrya viśvātmā dehamāviśya cakriṇaḥ| avārpa vaiṣṇavīṃ nidrāmekīṃ bhūya(.......)viṣṇunā| sahasraśīrṣa
<l3.>nayanaḥ śaṅkhacakragadādharaḥ brahmā nārāyaṇākhyo'sau suṣvāpa salile tadā ityādigranthe viṣṇuśarīrakapraveśakamahimnaiva caturmukhasahasraśīrṣatvādidharmavatvaṃ nārāyaṇasamākhyābhāktvaṃ ca pratipādayatā 
<l4.> nārāyaṇaśabdasya caturmukhe lākṣaṇikatva(-)mevāvagamyata iti ṣaṣṭhādhyāyastha caturmukhaparanārāyaṇaśabdo'pi lākṣaṇika eva yakta iti vācyaṃ lakṣaṇayā yatkiñcit śakyasambandhamātratvopapādyatvena 
<l5.> tadupapādanārthaṃ viṣṇuśarīrapraveśaparyantadhāvanasya mudhā prayāsarūpatvāt lākṣaṇikatve rūḍhaśabdavācakanārāyaṇākhyāśabdasya svārasyabhaṅgāpatteśca sahasraśīrṣādidharmavatvamapi caturmukhasyaiśvaryamahimnā 
<l6.> svata evopapannaṃ tasmāt tātkālikaviṣṇuśarīrapraveśamātrameva tatra varṇyate na tu tasya śi sahasraśīrṣatvādihetutvamapi tatrāpi caturmukhe nārāyaṇaśabdaprayogo mukhya eva nanu kaurmaṣaṣṭhādhyāyagatacaturmukhapara
<l7.>nārāyaṇaśabdaprayogaḥ pradarśanavidyā nyāyena caturmukhāntaryāmi nārāyaṇapara ityavaśyaṃ vācyam anyathā asya pṛthivyuddharaṇārthavarāharūpaparigrahoktirvirudhyeta na ca āvo vā idamagre 
<l8.> salilamāsīdityādiśrutau caturmukhasyāpi pṛthivyuddharaṇārthavarāharūpaparigrahapratipādanāt na virodha iti vācyaṃ tathā sati dṛṣṭvā daṃṣṭrāgravinyastapṛthvīprathitapauruṣam 
<l9.> a stuvan analokasthā siddhā brahmarṣayo hariṃ itthaṃ sa bhagavān viṣṇuḥ sanakādyairabhiṣṭutaḥ| ityādi samanantaragranthe daṃṣṭrayā mahīmuddhṛtavato mahāvarāhasya hariviṣṇvādiśabdai 
<l10.> vyapadeśasyāsamañjasyāpakteḥ varāhaśabdasya viṣṇusādhāraṇatvaprasiddhivirodhācca toyāntāṃ sa mahīṃ jñātvā jagatyekārṇave prabhuḥ| anumānāttaduddhāraṃ kartukāmaḥ prajāpatiḥ 
<l11.> (.......)rocca(........)manyāṃ kalpādiṣu yathā purā| matsyakūrmadikāṃ tadvadvārāhaṃ rūpamāśritaḥ| devayajñamayaṃ rūpaṃ aśeṣaṃ 
<l12.> jagatasthitau| sthitasthirātmā sarvātmā paramātmā prajāpa(........) 
<l12.>ddheḥ sa kanakādyairabhiṣṭutaḥ| āviveśa tadā toyamātmā dharo dharādhara iti viṣṇupurāṇopabrahmaṇānurodhena āpo vā ityādi śruterviṣṇuparatvasyaiva vaktavyatvā
<l13.>(.......................)ṇamapi caturmukhaviṣayakameveti vācyam| matsyakūrmādikāmiti dṛṣṭāntā sāṅgatyāpatteḥ ityādirūpasya vaiṣṇavatvainaiva prasiddheḥ | namaste puṇḍarīkaśaṅkhacakragadādhare 

<p25a., F22b., l1.> (……)syopi vārāharūpaparigrahāṅgīkāre uddhṛtā śivarāheṇa kṛṣṇena śatabāhunā iti śrutyantaravirodhāpatteśca na ca kvacitkalpaviśeṣe caturmukhasyāpi pṛthivyuddharaṇā
<l2.>(.......................)syata iti śrutidvayasyāpyavirodha iti vācyam evaṃ sati varāhapurāṇasthena kalpe kalpe bhavāneva māṃ samuddharate prabho na cāhaṃ vedmi te sūtiṃ ādisargaṃ ca keśaveti 
<l3.> mahā(.......................)sarveṣvapi kalpeṣu viṣṇoreva pṛthivyuddhārakatvapratipādanapareṇa virodhāpatteḥ tasmāt kaurmaṣaṣṭhādhyāyagatanārāyaṇaśabdaścaturmukhāntaryāmi nārāyaṇapara eva na caturmu
<l4.>(.......................)yaṃ samādhiḥ| nātra pratardanavidyānyāyena nārāyaṇaśabdaprayogaścaturmukhāntaryāmi nārāyaṇapara iti śakyate vaktuṃ śiva eva sarvāntaryāmi nānya iti pūrvamupapāditatvena nārāyaṇasya 
<l5.> caturmukhāntaryāmitvābhāvāt paraṃ tu kaurmaṣaṣṭhādhyagatasya ekārṇave tadā tasminnityādisandarbhasya viṣṇuvyūhāvatārarūpacaturmukhaparatvaṃ vaiṣṇavarūpādhiṣṭhātṛsvatantracaturmukhaparatvaṃ ca prāgupa
<l6.>pāditaṃ tathā ca pṛthivyuddharaṇārthavarāharūpaparigrahasya vaiṣṇavatvaprasiddheḥ dṛṣṭvā daṃṣṭrāgretyādisamanantaragranthasandarbhasya toyāntāṃ sa mahīmityādiviṣṇupurāṇopabrahmaṇasya 
<l7.> uddhṛtāsi varāheṇeti śrutyantarasya kalpe kalpe bhavāneveti varāhavacanasya ca na virodhaḥ sarvāpyasya vyūhavyūhavatorabhedopacāramabhipretya viriñcādhiṣṭhitavaiṣṇavarūpamabhipretya vā 
<l8.> pravṛttatvāt na caivaṃ viṣṇuvyūhāvatārarūpacaturmukhe nārāyaṇaśabdaprayoge'pi nārāyaṇaśabdo viṣṇvāsādha(dhā)raṇa ityasya na hāniriti vācyam evaṃ sati sarvasyāpi cidacidātma
<l9.>kaprapañcasya paramate viṣṇuśarīratvena nārāyaṇaśabdasya yatra kvāpi prayoge'pi viṣṇvaikāntyaṃ na bhagnamiti nārāyaṇaśabdo viṣṇoreva vācakaḥ| nānyasyeti parābhimataṃ viṣṇvaikāntyaṃ vāco 
<l10.> yuktimeva na saheta tasmāt svavyūhāvatārarūpe svaśarīrarūpe vānyasminnārāyaṇaśabdo na vartata ityeva parairaṅgīkāryaṃ taccānupapannaṃ svavyūhā(-)vatārarūpe caturmukhe nārāyaṇaśabda
<l11.>prayogasya kūrmapurāṇe upalambhāt evaṃ viṣṇupurāṇe'pi tri(tṛ)tīyādhyāye nārāyaṇākhyo bhagavān brahmā lokapitāmahaḥ| utpannaḥ procyate vidvānnitya evopacārata iti parāśara
<l12.>vacanena caturmukhe nārāyaṇaśabdaprayoga upalabhyate| na cātra nārāyaṇākhya ityasya brahmetyanena nānvayaḥ| kiṃ tu nārāyaṇākhyo bhagavānnityopyupacārāt brahmā brahmarūpeṇotpanna iti procyata 
<l13.> ityanvayaḥ| juṣa nṛjoguṇaṃ tatra svayaṃ viśveśvaro hariḥ| brahmā bhūtvāsya jagataḥ visṛṣṭau saṃpravartata iti pūrvagranthānurodhāditi vācyam| avyavahitasya utpu(tpa)nna ityasyaiva vidheyatve saṃbhavati vyavahitasya brahme
<l14.>tyasyāpi vidheyako vipraveśe gauravāt nityasyotpattiḥ kathamiti tāvanmātrasyaivākāṅkṣitatvācca ākāṅkṣānusāreṇaiva uddeśyavidheyabhāvakalpanasya nyāyyatvāccaturthepyadhyāye brahmā nārā
<l15.>yaṇākhyo'sau kalpādau bhagavānyathā| sasarja sarvabhūtāni tadācakṣva mahāmune| iti maitreyavacane spaṣṭameva caturmukhe nārāyaṇaśabdaprayoga upalabhyate tasmānnārāyaṇaśabdaprayo

<p25b., F23a., l1.>gamasya viṣṇvā vai kāntyamanupapannameveti paramaśive tasya paurāṇikarūḍhau dīkṣitairuktāyāṃ na kiñcidapi sādhakamityabhiprāyeṇa| kaurme caturmukhaśiśāvapi candramaule nārāyaṇānvayani(............................) 
<l2.>ryamāṇā| aikāntyamabjanayane niruṇadhyamuṣyāḥ tasmādiyaṃ tvayi virājati nirvivādā| asmākaṃ tu kevalayaugikatve'pi ṇatvaṃ nānupapannamityatraiva saṃrambhāt na rūḍhisādhane viśiṣyāgrahaḥ tasmādvastutaḥ 
<l3.> padādividhereva  padādividhiśabdena vivakṣāyāṃ na ko'pi doṣaḥ evaṃ sati api padādiśabdoccāraṇapūrvakatvābhāvenāpadādividhitvāt uttarapadatve ceti vārtikapravṛtyā nakārasya nimittavat 
<l4.> padabhinnapadavṛttitvābhāvāt ṇatvasya siddhatvāt pūrvapadāditi sūtrasya tatra sidhyarthatvāsaṃbhavena niyamārthatvameveti kapimuṣṭinyāyaḥ tadāpi tuṣyatu durjana iti nyāyena sthalāntare pūrvapadāditi sūtrasya vidhyartha
<l5.>mupavarṇyata ityāha| evaṃ sthitāvapi vibho kapimuṣṭirītyā kātyāyanīya(-)mapadādividhāvitīdaṃ tacchabdasaṃvyavahṛtisthala eva cet syāt doṣastato'pi na bhavediti varṇayāmaḥ| ayamatra varṇanaprakāraḥ 
<l6.> ramyabhavaṇadhanādyādhunikasaṃjñāśabdeṣu pūrvapadāditi sūtrasya vidhyarthatvaṃ saṃbhavatyeva na hyatra bhavanaśabde madhyapade aṭkupvāṅiti sūtreṇa ṇatvaṃ sidhyati madhyamapadasyottarapadatve ceti vārtikokta
<l7.>pratyayalakṣaṇapratiṣedhaviṣayatvenāntarvartinīṃ vibhaktimāśritya padatvānapāyāt na ca ramyabhavaṇā(-)dyādhunikasaṃjñāśabdānāṃ vede loke vā kvacidapi prayogasyādarśanena sādhutvasyaivāniścayāttatra vidhya
<l8.>rthaṃ pūrvapadāditi sūtramiti vāco yuktirevānupapanneti vācyam| na sādhutvamāsmākīnena prayogadarśanenāvadhārthaṃ sarveṣāṃ sādhuśabdānāṃ prayogasyāsarvajñadujñānatvāt 
<l9.> ata e(eva) pāṇinikātyāyanapatañjayo maharṣayaḥ sarveṣāṃ śabdānāṃ śṛṅgagrāhikayā pratipadamupadeśasyāśakyatayā sarvānapi sādhvasādhuśabdānārṣeṇa darśanena jñātvā vyākaraṇa
<l10.>śāstre praṇīte ye vyākaraṇānvākhyātāḥ śabdāsta eva sādhava iti sukhena sarve'pi jānīyuriti niścitya lokānugrahārthavyākaraṇaśāstraṃ praṇinyu tasmādvyākaraṇaikasamadhigamyameva 
<l11.> sādhutvam uktaṃ ca hariṇā| anapabhraṣṭatānādiryadvābhyudayayogyatā| vyākriyā vyajanīyā vā jatiḥ kāpīha sādhiteti| anapabhraṣṭatvaṃ vā anāditvaṃ vā abhyudayayogyatvaṃ vā abhyudaya
<l12.>geyāgyatāvacchedaka(-)vyākaraṇavyaṅgajātiviśeṣo vā sādhutvamiti ślokārthaḥ tathā prakṛte pūrvapadāditi sūtrasavidhyarthatvameva pāṇinerabhipretaṃ na tu niyamārthatvaṃ niyamārthatve aga iti sūtre śeṣa
<l13.>sya vidhyarthatvapakṣe saṃjñābhūta(-)ṛgayanādiśabdeṣu ṇatvavyāvartakatvenābhimatasya niyamāpavādatvameva syāt tathā saṃjñābhūtānāmasaṃjñābhūtānāṃ ca ṛgayanādiśabdānāṃ ṇatvaṃ durvāraṃ syāt  na cāga 
<l14.> iti yogaṃ vibhajya yogavibhāgasāmarthyāt ṇatvasyaivāyamapavādaḥ na tu niyamasyeti kalpyata iti vācyam evaṃ satyaga ityanena raṣābhyāṃ no ṇaḥ samānapade aṭkupvāṅnuṃvyavāyepīti sūtra
<l15.>prāptameva ṇatvaṃ vāryate iti vaktavyaṃ na tu pūrvapadāditi sūtraprāptaṃ tasya vidhyarthatvābhāvāt tathā ca rugṇaṃ rāgeṇetyādāvapi ṇatvaṃ na syāt na cāga iti yoge pūrva
<l16.>sūtramanuvartate tathā ca gakārāntāt pūrvapadāt parasya nasya ṇatvaṃ vārya iti rugaṇamityādau na doṣa iti vācyaṃ tathā sati saṃjñāyāmeva ṇatvaniṣedhenāsaṃjñābhūtṛgayanādiśabdeṣu ṇatvasya durvāra 

<p26a., F23b., l1.> na ca saṃjñāyāmiti nānuvartate pūrvapadāditimātramanuvartate tathā ca noktadoṣa iti vācyam evamatikusṛṣṭikalpanena pūrvapadāditi sūtrasya niyamārthatvanirvāhe'pi saṃjñāyāṃ yadi ṇatvaṃ tarhi pūrvapadasthānnimittāt 
<l2.>parasyaiveti viparītaniyamasyāpi vinigamanāviraheṇa durvāratvāt na ceṣṭāpattiḥ tathā sati vibhīṣaṇa ityādau ṇatvaṃ na syāt na ca śivādigaṇe suṣeṇaśabdaḥ paṭhyate tannirdeśasāmarthyāt viparītaniyamo na saṃbhavata iti vācyaṃ vibhīṣa
<l3.>ṇādiśabdeṣviva suṣeṇaśabde'pi ṇatvasya sādhutve prāpte tatsādhutvajñāpanārthastannirdeśa iti vaktuṃ śakyatvāt tasmāt pūrvapadāditi sūtrasya yadi kathañcidapi vidhyarthaṃ na saṃbhavati tadā 
<l4.> vyākhyādviparītaniyamaṃ vyāvartya kleśena niyamārthatvaṃ varṇanīyaṃ syāt saṃbhavatītvasya vidhyarthatvaṃ yadā ramyabhavanādiśabdāḥ saṃjñātvena viniyujyante tadā tatra ṇatvavidhyarthatvāt tathā ca saṃjñātve ṇatvaviśiṣṭā eva 
<l5.> te sādhavaḥ asaṃjñātve tu na tvaviśiṣṭā iti vyākaraṇenaiva sādhutvamavagamyate aprayukteṣu śabdeṣu yathā vyākaraṇameva sādhutvasya kalpanīyatvāt ata eva kṣṇāntā ṣaḍiti sūtre bhāṣye aṣṭana āvibha
<l6.>ktāvityatra rāyo halīti aparṣamāśritya evaṃ sati priyāṣṭau priyāṣṭā iti na syāt priyāṣṭānau priyāṣṭāna iti tu prāpnotītyāśaṅkya yathā lakṣaprayukta iti parihṛtam evaṃ vadadbhiḥ bhāṣyakṛdbhiranu
<l7.>prayukteṣu yathā vyākaraṇameva sādhutvamavadhāryamityuktaṃ bhavati ata eva manoramāyāṃ rātsasyeti sūtre takārapraśleṣapakṣe kīrtayateḥ kvipi acikirat ityādāvapi takāralo
<l8.>pasyādityaśaṅkya yathālakṣaṇamapayukta iti bhāṣye parihṛtaṃ kroṣṭuśabdaprakriyāvasare sūtrasya vidhyarthamupapādayadbhirvṛttikṛdādibhirudāhṛteṣu druṇasa giriṇasā
<l9.>diśabdeṣvapi eṣaiva rītiḥ śaraṇīkaraṇīyā druṇasādiśabdā nāmaprayuktatvāviśeṣāt nanvevamapi aga ityasya tvatpakṣe prayojanaṃ na paśyāmaḥ| na ca vācyaṃ saṃjñābhūta
<l10.>ṛgayanādiśabdeṣu aṭkupvāṅiti bādhitvā paratvāt pūrvapadāditi prāptasya ṇatvasya vāraṇameva prayojanamiti asaṃjñā ṛgayanādiśabdeṣu ṇatvavāraṇārthaṃ 
<l11.> teṣāṃ kṣubhnāditvakalpanasyāvaśyakatayā tenaiva saṃjñābhūteṣvapi teṣu ṇatvasaṃbhavāditi cenna manmate'pi aga iti yogaṃ vibhajya tatra pūrvapadāditimātramanuvartya gakārāntāt 
<l12.> pūrvapadāt parasya ṇatvaṃ neti vyākhyānena ṛgayanādiśabdeṣvasaṃjñā saṃjñāsādhāraṇyena ṇatvavāraṇasyaiva prayojanatvasaṃbhavena ṛgayanādiśabdānāṃ kṣubhnādipāṭha(-)syaivākalpa
<l13.>nīyatvāt na caivamapi vastutaḥ padādividhiśabdena padādividhireva vivakṣita iti pūrvoktapakṣe aga ityetat pūrvapadāditi sūtreṇa ekavākyaṃ bhūtvā ṛgnagaramityādhunikasaṃjñāśabdeṣu ṇatvavā
<l14.>raṇena saprayojanaṃ syāt tathā ca nṛgayanādibhya iti nirdeśādevā(va) aga ityasyodāharaṇatvenābhimate ṛgayanādiśabde ṇatvavāraṇenāga ityetadvyarthamityākāroktirvirudhyeteti vācyaṃ tādṛśā
<l15.>dhunikasaṃjñāśayo aprasiddheḥ prasiddhau aga iti yogaṃ vibhajya ṛgnagaram ṛgayanamityādau prāptaṃ ṇatvaṃ sarvamapi ṇatvam aga ityanena vāryate tathā ca ubhayathā pakṣa ityādinirdeśenāntavat bhāvena 
<l16.> padāntasya na visarga iti sāmānyato yathā jñāpyate tathā ca arṇagayanādibhya ityādinirdeśena gagārāntapūrvapadāt parasya ṇatvamiti sāmānyato jñāpyata iti manmate'pyākaroktiraviruddhaiva na nṛttā
<l17.>karagranthasya ṛgnagaraṃ ṛgayanamityādau prāptaṃ sarvamapi ṇatvamaga iti yogavibhāgena vāryate tattu arṇagayanādibhya iti nirdeśādeva sāmānyāpe

<p26b., F24a., l1.>kṣajñāpakāt siddhamityaga iti vyarthamiti nābhiprāyaḥ kiṃ tu pūrvapadāditi sūtreṇa druṇasādiśabdeṣviva saṃjñābhūtṛgayanādiśabdeṣvapi ṇatvaprāptau aga ityetat pūrvavadādityanenaikavākyasya devatādvāra
<l2.>yatītyāśayaḥ etadāśayaparyālocane ca ṇatvavidhāvuttarapadatve ceti vārtikaṃ na pravartate iti jñāpyata iti kathaṃ nārāyaṇaśabde ṇatvaṃ sidhyati na ca vinigamanāvirahādasmāduktāśaya eva vastviti vācyaṃ saṃbhavatyekavākya
<l3.>tve vākyabhedakalpanasyātyācyatvāt anekeṣāṃ śabdānāṃ kṣubhnāditvakalpāprasaṅgācceti cenna nārāyaṇaśabdasya halādivibhaktau ṇatvasidhyarthamuttarapadatve ca padādivadhāvityevaṃ rūpaṃ vārtikamaṅgīkurvatāṃ bhāṣya
<l4.>kṛtāṃ ṇatvavidhāvuttarapadatve ceti vārtikaṃ pravartata eveti spaṣṭamevāśayaḥ pratīyate tadavirodhārthaṃ prakṛtasyāpi ākaragranthasyādasmadukta evāśaya ityavaśyaṃ vaktavyatvāt tasmādvastutaḥ padādividhireva padā
<l5.>dividhiśabdena vivakṣita iti pūrvoktapakṣena kāpyanupapattiḥ padādiśabdoccāraṇapūrvako vidhiḥ padādividhiśabdena vivakṣita iti pakṣe'pi ramyabhavaṇadhanādisaṃjñāśabdeṣu pūrvapadāditi sūtrasya 
<l6.> vidhyarthatvavāco yuktirapi upapannaiva na caivamapi ramyabhavaṇadhanādisaṃjñāśabdānāmādhunikasaṃjñātvena na cirantanasaṃjñāviṣayakapūrvapadāditi sūtraviṣayatvamiti vācyaṃ cirantanādhunikasaṃjñāḥ sādhāraṇa
<l7.>saṃjñātvasāmānyāvacchinnasaṃjñāvācinaḥ pūrvapadāditisūtrasthasaṃjñāmātrāviṣayakatvena saṅkocakalpanasyānyāyyatvāt pratyutādhunikasaṅketitaśabdasyaiva saṃjñātvena vyākaraṇe 
<l8.> vyavahāraḥ na cirantanasya ata eva dikṣu cirantanasaṅketavato dakṣiṇādiśabdasya ma(a)saṃjñātvamaṅgīkṛtya diśaḥ sapatnī bhava dakṣiṇasyā(sya) ityādau pūrvaparāvaretyādisūtreṇa sarvanāmakā
<l9.>ryā sidhyati kuruṣvādhunikasaṅketavata uttarādiśabdasya saṃjñātvamaṅgīkṛtya uttarāḥ kurava ityādāvasaṃjñāyāmiti pratiṣedhāt sarvakāryaṃ nāsti dikṣu cirantanaḥ saṅketaḥ kuruṣvā
<l10.>dhunika ityatra vyākhyātṛvacanameva pramāṇamiti bhaṭṭojiyajvaprabhṛtaya āhuḥ| etatsarvamabhipretyāha| uccāṭitadruṇasadeśamapi smarāre deśāntarāptavidhipūrvapadādi(........)yo
<l11.>gaṃ ruṇaddhi na tavetthamacetane'pi tvaddeṣi cetanajanasya kathaṃ na lajjā| nanvevamapi pūrvapadādityanenottarapadasyākṣepāt pūrvapadasthānnimittāt parasya uttarapadasthasya 
<l12.> nasya ṇatvamityartho labhya iti madhyamapadasyottarapadatvā(-)bhāvāt kathaṃ ramyabhavaṇadhanādiśabdaviṣayatvaṃ pūrvapadāditi sūtrasya vaktuṃ yuktaṃ na ca madhyamapadasyāpi pūrvapadāpekṣayottarapadatva
<l13.>mastyeveti vācyam| samāsacaramāvayave uttarapadaśabdo yogarūḍha iti kaustubhādigrantheṣūdghāṭitatvādityata āha| tvadyogarodhanabhayādaphala(........)taścācikṣepanottarapadaṃ 
<l14.> khalu sūtrametat| evaṃ ca madhyamapade kṛtasaṃvidhānaṃ tvadyogameva samupāsta umārthamūrte| pūrvottarapadayoranyatareṇānyatarākṣepo na nayataḥ kiṃ tu phalamahimnākalpyaḥ pūrvapadā
<l15.>diti sūtrasya vidhyarthatvapakṣe uttarapadākṣepasya niṣprayojanatvena tadanākṣepādata evānandrato dvandva ityatra uttarapadena pūrvapadasyānākṣepāt hotṛpotṛneṣṭodgātāra 
<l16.> ityādau neṣṭrādiśabdasyānasiddhaḥ striyāḥ puṃvadityatrāpi pūrvapadānnākṣepāt citrā jaradguriti tripadabahuvrīhau jaratīśabdasya puṃvadbhāvaḥ siddhaḥ yatra tu prayojanamasti 

<p27a., F24b., l1.> tatrottarapadākṣepo jñāpakādvyākhyānādvārṇiyate yathā prātipadikāntanuṃ vibhaktiṣu cetyatra uttarapadaṃ yat prātipadikaṃ tadantasya nakārasyeti – yadyatrottarapadānākṣepaḥ 
<l2.> tadā gargāṇāṃ bhaginī gargabhaginītyatrāpi ṇatvaṃ vikalpa

(paḥ) syāt atra cākṣepe nuṃgrahaṇajñāpakamiti vṛttikārā āhuḥ| uttarapadānekṣepe māṣavāṇītyatra numaḥ prātipadi
<l3.>kāntatvenaiva ṇatvavikalpe siddhe nuṃgrahaṇaṃ vyarthaṃ syāt uttarapadākṣepe tu aṅgabhaktasya numaḥ uttarapadānavayavatvena uttarapadarūpaprātipadikāntatvābhāvāt 
<l4.> nuṃgrahaṇaṃ vyarthavadbhavati bhaṭṭojiyajvānastu prahiṇvannityādau ṇatvārthatvena nuṃgrahaṇasya caritārthatvāt vyākhyānādevātrottarapadākṣepa ityāhuḥ| yadi pūrvottarapadayora
<l5.>ranyatareṇānyatarākṣepo niyata(taḥ) syāt tadātrākṣepavyākhyānajñāpanayoḥ pramāṇatvāśrayaṇaṃ granthakṛtāmanupapannaṃ syāt svā(sva)bhāvādeva pūrvottarapadayorākṣepakatvāsaṃ
<l6.>bhavāt tasmāt prayojanabalādevākṣepaḥ kartavya iti siddhaṃ tathā ca prakṛte prayojanābhāvāduttarapadākṣepo na saṃbhavatyeva ata eva kāśikāyāṃ druṇasādisaṃjñāśabdeṣvapi 
<l7.> samāsotpannavibhaktimādāya samānapadatvāt aṭkupvāṅiti sūtreṇaiva ṇatvasya siddhatvāt pūrvapadāditi sūtrasya niyamārthatvaṃ prathamamupavarṇya mātṛbhogi(gī)
<l8.>ṇa ityādyasaṃjñāśabdeṣvapi ṇatvāsiddhamāśaṅkya uttarapadākṣepakalpanena tāṃ parihṛtya tataḥ pare tvityādinā pūrvapadāditi sūtrasya vidhyarthatvamupapādya tat 
<l9.> pakṣe prayojanābhāvaṃ manasi nidhāya uttarapadākṣepo nāghrātaḥ| iyāṃstu viśeṣaḥ kāśikādigrantheṣu uttarapadatve ceti vārtike vastutaḥ padādividhireva 
<l10.> paryudasyata ityāśritya rāmanāmādiśabdeṣviva druṇasādisaṃjñāśabdeṣvapi nimittavat padabhinnapadasthatvāt nakārasyāṭkupvāṅiti sūtre ṇatvaṃ na sidhyatīti tatra 
<l11.> ṇatvasiddhyarthaṃ pūrvapadāditi sūtramityuktam asmābhistu padādiśabdoccāraṇapūrvaka eva vidhiḥ paryudasyata iti pakṣamaṅgīkṛtyāpi druṇasādisaṃjñāśabdeṣū(-)ttarapadasya 
<l12.> uttarapadatve ceti vārtikena pratyayalakṣaṇa(-)pratiṣedhāt subantatvābhāvenāpadatvāt ṇatvamaṭkupvāṅiti sūtreṇaiva siddhamiti ramyabhavaṇadhanādyādhunikasaṃjñāśabdeṣu ṇatvavidhyarthaṃ 
<l13.> pūrvapadāditi sūtramucyata iti tathā ca pūrvapadāditi sūtrasya niyamārthatvāyogāt nārāyaṇaśabde ṇatvaṃ nirābādhameva na caivamapi nārāyaṇaśabda iva rāmanāmādiśabdeṣvapi ṇatvaṃ 
<l14.> duṣpariharamiti vācyaṃ teṣāṃ kṣubhnādyākṛtigaṇapraviṣṭatvakalpanena ṇatvasya supariharatvāt pūrvapadāditi sūtrasya vidhyatvavādīnāṃ kāśikā(kākā)rādīnāmapi mate rāmavanādiśabdānāmanantānāṃ 
<l15.> kṣubhnāditvasyāvaśyaṃ kalpanīyatvāt iyāṃ viśeṣaḥ anādibhūtottarapadagatanakārāṇāṃ rāmavanādiśabdānāmeva kāśikā(-)rādimate  kṣubhnāditvaṃ kalpyam asmanmate tu ādibhūtottara
<l16.>padagatanakārāṇāmapi rāmanāmādiśabdānāṃ kṣubhnāditvaṃ kalpyamiti na ca sūtrasya niyamārthatve kasyāpi 

<p27b., F25a., l1.> śabdasya kṣubhnāditvaṃ na kalpyamiti lāghavamiti vācyaṃ siddhe satyārambho niyamārtha iti nyāyena saṃbhavati vidhau niyamārthatvasyāyuktatvāt na cānantānā rāmanāmādiśabdānāṃ kāśikākārādyasammatakṣubhnāditvakalpa
<l2.>namanyāyyamiti vācyaṃ pūrvapadāditi sūtrasya niyamārthatvapakṣe anantānāramyabhavaṇadhanādiśabdānāmapaśabdatvakalpanasyāvarjanīyatvatayā tadapekṣayā maduktarītyā ubhayeṣāmapi śabdānāṃ sādhutvavarṇana
<l3.>syaiva nyāyatvāt na ca ramyabhavaṇadhanādisaṃjñāśabdānāmapyutpattipakṣe tatra ṇatvavidhyarthaṃ pūrvapadāditi sūtramiti vāco yuktirevānupapanneti vācyaṃ evaṃ sati druṇasādisaṃjñāśabdānāmapyu
<l4.>tpattipakṣe tatra pūrvapadāditi sūtraṃ vidhyarthamiti kāśikākārādyasaṅgatā syāt vyutpattipakṣamādāya taduktinirvāhe prakṛte tulyaṃ tasmāt uttarapadatve ceti vārtike vastutaḥ padādividhi
<l5.>pakṣe padādiśabdoccāraṇapūrvakavidhipakṣe ca nārāyaṇaśabdasya paramaśive yaugikatve'pi ṇatvaṃ nirābādhameva paraṃ tu vastutaḥ padādividhipakṣe paraścāsau carthaśca paramatena paramavā
<l6.>cā evaṃ paramakāparatvenetyādau kutvajatvanalopādayaḥ prāpnuvanti cakārādīnāṃ vastutaḥ padāditvena uttarapadatve ceti vārtikāpravṛtyāntarvartivibhaktimāśritya padatvānapāyāt 
<l7.> te'pi layathālakṣaṇamaprayuktā iti bhāṣyoktarītyā samādheyāḥ yadi tu svaṃ sati anantānāṃ śabdānāṃ kṣubhnāditvakalpanamarthaviśeṣa(-)viśiṣṭasya nārāyaṇaśabdasya kṣubhnāditvakalpanaṃ ca doṣā
<l8.>vahamityetaddoṣaparihārāya uttarapadatve ceti vārtike padādiśabdoccāraṇapūrvaka eva vidhiḥ padādividhiḥ padādividhiśabdena vivakṣitaḥ pūrvapadāditi sūtraṃ niya
<l9.>mārthameva ramyabhavaṇadhanādiśabdāstu avyutpannā eva na tatra pūrvapadāditi sūtrasya vidhyatvamiti prakārāntareṇaiva ṇatvaṃ sādhanīyamityucyate tarhi prakārāntareṇāpi 
<l10.> ṇatvamupapādyata ityāha| tvadveṣi(-)kalpitakudūṣaṇaleśagandho yogaṃ yathaiva tava nākramate purāre| nārāyaṇāhvayajuṣaṃ tanumastathaiva kiṃ kiṃ nakārayati te'dya kṛpā 
<l11.> na vadyā| tathā hi nārāhiradbhiḥ īyate svasaṃbandhitayā prāpyata iti vā nāreṇa narasamūhena īyate upāsyata yā prāpyata iti vā nārāyaṇaḥ kṛtyalyuṭo bahulamiti bahulagraha
<l12.>ṇāt karmaṇi lyuṭ gatikārakopadānāṃ kṛdbhiḥ saha samāsavacanaṃ prāk subutpatteriti paribhāṣayā asubantenaivā(-)yanaśabdena nāraśabdasya kartṛkaraṇe kṛtā bahulamiti samāse 
<l13.> uttarabhāgasyāyanaśabdasyāsubantatvena padatvābhāvāt nimittavat padabhinnapadavṛttitvābhāvavatoyana nakārasya ṇatvaṃ niṣpṛtyūhameva evaṃ ca rāma(-)nāmādiśabdeṣu ṇatvaṃ na prasajyata eveti 
<l14.> teṣāṃ kṣubhnāditvaṃ na kalpyaṃ tārasyāyanamityādāvapi tāraśabdasya kārakatvābhāvena gatikāraketi paribhāṣāyā apravṛtyā subantenaivāyanaśabdena samāse uttarabhāgasya padatvena bhāve 
<l15.> ṇatvau prasajyata evetyarthaviśeṣaviśiṣṭanārāyaṇaśabdasyāpi kṣubhnāditvaṃ na kalpyate na ca nārasyāyanaṃ nārāyanamityādau śeṣatvaṃ vivakṣāyāṃ kārakatvābhāve'pi kartṛtvaṃ karma

<p28a., F25b., l1.>tvaṃ vā vivakṣi tvā yadā kartṛkarmaṇoḥ kṛtīti ṣaṣṭhī tadā kārakatvāt gatikāraketi paribhāṣā pravṛtyā ṇatvaṃ durvāramiti vācyaṃ evaṃ sati kartṛkaraṇe kṛtā bahulamiti bahilagrahaṇāt kvacit subantenāpi kārakasya 
<l2.> samāsaḥ ata eva sā hi tasya dhanakritetyādiprayogaṃ sidhyati anyathā krītāt karaṇe pūrvapadāditiṃ dīṣidhakrītīti syāt subantena samāse tu subalakṣayā antaraṅgatvāt prathamaṃ ṭāpi kṛte ada natvābhāvāt ṣīṣa
<l3.>bhāve dhanakrīteti sidhyati tathā ca nārasyāyanabhinnārāyanamityādau yatra ṇatvaṃ neṣṭaṃ tatra subantena samāsaḥ yatra tu tadiṣṭaṃ tatrāsubantena samāsaḥ na caivaṃ nārā apyayanaṃ yasmāt tena nārāyaṇa smṛta iti kaurmagataṃ 
<l4.> bahuvrīhitvapradarśakaṃ śivaparanārāyaṇanāmanirvacanaṃ virudhyeteti vācyaṃ tasyārthikārthipradarśanaparatvena bahuvrīhipradarśakatvābhāvāt gatikārakopapadānāmiti paribhāṣā ca upapadamiti 
<l5.> 
indandityatrātiṅiti yogavibhāgena kartṛkaraṇe kṛtā bahulamityatra kṛteti krahaṇena ca siddheti bhāṣyakaiyyaṭayoruktaṃ tathā hi atiṅiti yogo vibhajyate pūrvasūtradvayoktaḥ samāsaḥ atikṣintasya ityasya 
<l6.> yogārthaḥ etatsāmarthyācca pūrvasūtradvaye supeti tṛtīyāntaṃ nānuvartata iti phalitaṃ tathā ca ru(ku)gatiprādayaḥ samarthena samasyante upapadaṃ samarthena samasyante iti ca tadarthaḥ| evaṃ kartṛkaraṇe 
<l7.> kṛtetyatra supetyāvṛtyaiva tiṅantena samāsāprāptau kṛteti grahaṇaṃ kṛdantāvasthāyāmeva samāsa iti lābhārthaṃ tena subutpatteḥ prāgeva samāsa iti labdhaṃ tasmānnārāyaṇaśabdasya 
<l8.> paramaśive yaugikatve ṇatvaṃ nirbādhameva yogarūḍhatvalākṣaṇikatve ca dīkṣitavaryaireva ṇatvaṃ sādhitaṃ tatra lākṣaṇikatvapakṣe kiñcidvicāryate nanu 
<l9.> nārāyaṇasya paramaśivādutpattiryadi prāmāṇikī tadā bhāvi nārāyaṇāvasthāviśiṣṭatvaṃ paramaśivasya ghaṭate tatraiva pramāṇaṃ na paśyāma ityata āha||32||

