<p28b., F26al1.> nārāyaṇa smṛtaḥ iti śruteḥ rudrasaṃjñasya devasya rūpe mūrtiḥ prajāyate| tena kṣiptaṃ rase vīryaṃ paramūrtyabhimāninā 
