<l4.>ṣṭhalaiṅgādipurāṇavacanaiśca naraśabdavācyaśivasṛṣṭāptatvāyatanatvalakṣaṇapravṛttinivṛttaśāliśivaprasādalabdhanārāyaṇasamākhyābhāt tvaṃ tāvat viṣṇoḥ pratīyate| na ca samākhyā lābhasya pravṛttinivṛtta
<l5.>mātrādhīnatvena śivaprasādalabdhatvaṃ kathamiti vācyaṃ yogarūḍhiśālinyāṃ nārāyaṇasamākhyāyāṃ yogāṃśasya pravṛttinivṛttamātrādhīnatvena śivaprasādalabdhatvaṃ kathamiti vācyaṃ yogarūḍhiśālinyāṃ nārāyaṇa
<l6.>samākhyāyāṃ yogāṃśasya pravṛttinimittamātrāpekṣitve'pi rūḍhyasya śivaprasādalabdhatvasambhavāt nanu manusmṛtyupakrame tata(taḥ) svayambhūrbhagavānavyakto vyañjayannidaṃ mahābhūtādivṛttau jāḥ 
<l7.> prādurāsīttamo nadaḥ| yo sā vatīndriyā grāhyaṃ sākṣmā vyaktaṃ sanātanam| apradarthamanirdeśyaṃ sa eva svayamudbabhau so bhidyāya śarīrāt sisṛkṣurvividhāḥ prajāḥ apa eva sasarjādau tāsu 
<l8.> vīryamapāsṛjat tadaṇḍamabhavaddhaimā sahasrāt samaprabhaṃ tasmin jajñe svayaṃ brahmā sarvalokapitāmahaḥ| āpo nārā iti proktā āpo vai narasūnavaḥ| tā yadasyāyanaṃ proktaṃ tena nārā
<l9.>yaṇa(ṇaḥ) smṛta iti smaryate tatra svayaṃbhuvo bhagavataḥ tamo nudasya so'bhidhyāyeti tacchabdena parāmṛṣṭasyāpāṃ sraṣṭuruttaratra nārāyaṇanāmanirvacanamahimnā nārāyaṇasvarūpatvaṃ sphuṭa
<l10.>mavagamyate tataścāptatvasya nārāyaṇasṛjyatvāvagamāt kathaṃ śivasṛjyatvamityata āha| āpā tatastavaharerapi bodhako yaḥ mulaśrute svarasataśca bhavatparatvaṃ prāpto 
<l11.> maheśvaramanostamupakramatvadācchādyamādhavaparaṃ bruvate kathaṃ vā| viṣva(śva)sādhāraṇaśabdābhāvena śivaviṣṇusādhāraṇatvena pratīyamānasya manusmṛtyupakramasya aṇḍaṃ hiraṇmayamadhye 
<l12.> samudraṃ rudrasya vīryāt prathamaṃ saṃbabhūvetyaptatve brahmāṇḍotpādakavīryakṣeptuḥ rudratvapratipādakamanusmṛtyupakramamūlabhūtanīlakaṇṭhabhāṣyokta
<l13.>śrutyanusāreṇa rudrasaṃjñasyetyādipūrvodāhṛtavāsiṣṭhalaiṅgādipurāṇavacanānusāreṇa ca rudraparatvasyaiva vaktavyatvāt upasaṃharasthanārāyaṇanāmanirvacanasya 
<l14.> upakramānusāreṇa śive'pi netuṃ śakyatvāt vastutastu tamo nuda ityasya pañcamyantasya prādurbhāvāvadhiparasya tamoṇuṇādhiṣṭhātṛrudravācakasya satvena tamo nudaḥ śivādviṣṇuḥ 
<l15.> prādurāsīdityarthāvagamāt manusmṛtyupakramaḥ śivapara eveti spaṣṭamavagamyate tathā ca so'bhidhyāyetyatra tacchabdaḥ prādurbhāvayitṛśivapara eva na tu prādurbhavitṛviṣṇuparaḥ vīryakṣeptṛ
<l16.>rudratvapratipādakapūrvoktanīlakaṇṭhabhāṣyodāhṛtaśrutivāsiṣṭhalaiṅgādipurāṇavacanānusāreṇa tasmādaptatvasya śivasṛjyatvena kiñcit bādhakaṃ na caivamapyudā

<p29a., F26b., l1.>hariṣyamāṇapādmādipurāṇavacanairguṇamūrtitrayāntargatasya saṃhārarudrasyaiva tamoguṇādhiṣṭhātṛtvamavagamyate na paramaśivasya nārāyaṇasraṣṭṛtvaṃ tu sarvamidaṃ brahmaviṣṇurādrendrāste 
<l2.> saṃprasūyanta ityātharvaśikhādivākyaiḥ paramaśivasyaivāvagamyate na saṃhārarudrasyeti kathaṃ tamo'dhiṣṭhāturnārāyaṇasraṣṭṛtvavarṇanamupapadyata vācyaṃ rudrasaṃjñasyetyādivāsiṣṭhalaiṅgādivacanaiḥ 
<l3.> ātamana ākāśaḥ saṃbhūta ityādisṛṣṭipratipādakavākyaiśca saṃhārarudrādapi nārāyaṇotpatterupapādayiṣyamāṇatvāt kiṃ ca tapasā toṣayitvā taṃ pitaraṃ parameśvaraṃ brahmanārāyaṇau pūrvaṃ rudramiti 
<l4.> kalpāntare sṛjadityādivāyupurāṇādivacaneṣu sphuṭameva saṃhārarudrasya nārāyaṇasraṣṭṛtvamavagamyate na ca tamo nuda iti padamiti gupadhasaṃjñā prīkiraḥ ka iti kapratyayāntaṃ sat prathamāntameva tathā 
<l5.> cātra prādurbhavitaiva pratīyate na tu prādurbhāvayitā sa ca prādurbhavitā viṣṇureva bhagavāniti śabdo'yaṃ  tathā puruṣa ityapi nirupādhi ca vartete vāsudeve sanātane iti purāṇavacanāvadhṛ
<l6.>taviṣṇvasādhāraṇabhāvabhagavacchabdasamabhivyāhārāttathā ca viṣṇusṛjyamevāptatvamiti vācyaṃ tamo nuda ityasya prathamāntatvābhyupagame'pi prādurbhavitā viṣṇurevetyatra na mānamasti bhagavacchabdasya 
<l7.> pūrvoktavacanānusāreṇa viṣṇau paurāṇikarūḍhyaṅgīkāre'pi sarvāṇīha vā etasya nāmadheyā(-)nītyāśvalāyanasmaraṇānusāreṇa nāmāni tava govindetyādi harivaṃśavacanānusā
<l8.>reṇa ca viṣṇau rūḍhasya tava śive'pi rūḍhatayā anutpādanapūrvatvāt svayambhuriti sa smṛtaḥ bhagavān sarvavijñānādavanādomiti smṛta iti kaurmavacanapratipāditayogena ca śive'pi 
<l9.> tasya yogarūḍhasya viṣṇvasādhāraṇyāsiddheḥ dasmādaṇḍaṃ hiraṇmayamityādiśrutivāsiṣṭhalaiṅgādivacanānusāreṇa prādurbhavitā śiva eva kiñcittamo nudaśabdasamabhivyāhārādapi 
<l10.> prādurbhavitā śiva eva tamo nudaśabdo hi tamo'pahatvaviśiṣṭavācakaḥ| tacca tamopahatatvaṃ vighneśvarasyeva vighnāpahatvaṃ tamoguṇaniyantuḥ rudrasyaivāñjasena  pratīyate na ca brahma
<l11.>nārāyaṇoriva rudrasyāpi sivaguṇavaśīkṛtatvena tamoguṇaniyantṛtvamevāsiddhamiti vācyam| brahmanārāyaṇayo(yoḥ) sva sva guṇavaśīkṛtatve'pi rudrasya tamoniyantṛtvasya purāṇa(-)siddhatvāt tathā 
<l12.> hi pādmapurāṇe smaryate ya ekaḥ śāśvato devaḥ brahmavandyaḥ sadāśivaḥ| trilocano guṇādhāro guṇātīto'kṣaro'vyayaḥ dakṣiṇenāsṛjat putraṃ brahmāṇaṃ vāmato hariṃ pṛṣṭhadeśānmaheśānaṃ 
<l13.> trīn putrānasṛjat prabhuḥ| jātamātrāstu te putrā(trāḥ) brahmaviṣṇumaheśvarāḥ| idamūcurvacaspaṣṭaṃ ko bhavān ke vayaṃ tviti| tānāha ca śivaḥ putrān yūyaṃ putrā ahaṃ pitā| idaṃ guṇatrayaṃ putrā bhajadhvaṃ 
<l14.> kāryahetutaḥ| satvaṃ brahmā rajo viṣṇurbhajenmāheśvarastamaḥ| ityuktamātro devena brahmā satvamathāgrahīt na ca dhārayituṃ śaktaḥ tamaśca kumu śaktimān taṃ guṇaṃ tu tiraskṛtya rajoguṇamathāgrahīt 

<p29b., F27a., l1.> na ca cālayituṃ śaktaṃ papāta ca ruroda ca| viṣṇuśca vāmahastena rajoguṇamadhārayat| rudro'ṅgulyāstvaguṇaṃ sa taṃ viṣṇumadhārayat| tāmasaṃ pādapīṭhe ca dadhāna ca nanarta cetyādi eteṣu hi vacaneṣu brahmaṇo 
<l2.> viṣvanugrahādrajo guṇadhāraṇaṃ viṣṇo rudrānugrahāt satvaguṇasādhāraṇaṃ rudrasya tu svata eva pādapīṭhe tamoguṇamadarśanasya kaṇṭhataḥ pratipādanāt rudrasya spaṣṭameva tamoguṇaniyantṛtvaṃ cāvagamyate| na caivamapyā
<l3.>sīdidaṃ tamobhūtamaprajñātalakṣaṇam apratamanirdeśyaṃ prasuptamiva sarvataḥ| iti sṛṣṭipūrvakāle māyāmātrāvaśeṣapratipādakapūrvaślokānusāreṇa tataśca svayambhūdityuttaraśloke tamo nuda ityatra tamaḥ 
<l4.> śabdasya māyāparatvameva pratīyate na tu tamoguṇaparatvaṃ yena rudraparatvameva samāditi vācyam| evamapi pūrvodāhṛtaśrutipurāṇavacanākabalena manusmṛtyupakramasya rudraparatvasyānivāryatvāt 
<l5.> kiṃ ca upasaṃhāraikavākyatābalenāpi manusmṛtyupakramasya rudraparatvameva kartavyaṃ tadupasaṃhāre hi praśāsitāraṃ sarveṣāmaṇīyāṃsamaṇorapi rutmābhaṃ svapnadhīgamyaṃ vidyāttu puruṣaṃ 
<l6.> paramiti sarvāntaryāmiṇaṃ puruṣamupadiśya sa ca sarvāṇi bhūtāni pañcabhirvyāpya mūrtibhiḥ janmavṛddhikṣayairnityaṃ saṃsārayati cakravaditi sadyojātādipañcabhirmūrtibhirjagadvyāpitaliṅgapradarśa
<l7.>nena tasya paramaśivarūpatvaṃ sphuṭīkṛtam| na ca pañcabhirmūrtibhirityanena pṛthivyāditi pañcabhūtānyucyante na sadyojātādayaḥ tathā ca pṛthivyādibhiḥ pañcabhirmūrtibhirjagadvyāpitanārāyaṇasyā
<l8.>pi ghaṭata iti paramaśivaikāntikaliṅgaṃ nātreti vācyam etat smṛtivākyamūlāttaittarīyaśrutau aṇoraṇīyān ṛtaṃ satyaṃ paraṃ brahma ādityo vā eṣa etanmaṇḍalaṃ namo hiraṇyabāhava 
<l9.> ityādinā sūryamaṇḍalāntarvartitvenopakrāntasya paramaśivasya sadyojātamityādibhirmantrai sadyojātādimūrtipañcakamabhidhāya sa vā eṣa puruṣaḥ pañcadhā pañcātmā yena sarva
<l10.>midaṃ protaṃ pṛthivī cāntarikṣaṃ cetyādinā tenaiva mūrtipaṃ ca kena tasya paramaśivasya jagadvyāpa

(pi)nopasaṃhārapradarśanena etat smṛtivākyasthena pañcabhirmūrtibhirityanenā
<l11.>pi sadyojātādimūrtipañcakābhidhānasyaivāvaśyāṅgīkartavyatvāt nanu upakramānusāreṇaiva upasaṃhāro neyaḥ na tūpasaṃhārānusāreṇopakramanayanaṃ yuktam ata eva tri(tṛ)tīyā
<l12.>dhyāye śruterjātādhikārasyāditi sūtreṇa agne ṛgvedo vāyoryajurveda ādityāt sāmaveda ityupakrame ṛgvedāde(deḥ) stutau gamyamānāyāmapi uccairucā kriyate ityupasaṃhārastha
<l13.>pradhānabhūtavidhivākyagatṛgādipadānusāreṇa ṛgvedādipadānāmṛci lakṣaṇeti pūrvapakṣaṃ prāpayya

(pya) vedo vā prāyadarśanāditi sūtreṇa sañcātavirodhitvenopakramasya 
<l14.> prābalyāt tat ga ṛgvedādiśabdānusāreṇaiva upasaṃhārasthṛgādipadānāṃ pradhānabhūtavidhivākyagatānāmapi ṛgvedādau lakṣaṇeti siddhāntitamiti cenna yatra upasaṃhāramanape(-)
<l15.>kṣyaiva upakramasyārthanirṇayastatraivopakramaprābalyanayaḥ prakṛte copasaṃhārāpekṣayaiva manusmṛtyupakrame'rthanirṇayasya vaktavyatvenopakramaprābalyānavatārāt 

<p30a., F27b., l1.> ata eva dvitīyādhyāye sandigdhe tu vākyaśeṣādityatroktāḥ śarkarā upadhātītyupakramasya tejo vai ghṛtamityupasaṃhārānusāreṇārthanirṇayaḥ siddhāntitaḥ tasmāt prakṛte upasaṃhārānusāre
<l2.>ṇopakramanayanaṃ yuktameva tasmāt tamo nuda ityasya prathamāntatvapakṣe'pi tamo nudaḥ rudraḥ prādurāsīdityevārthaḥ paramārthatastu tamo nuda ityasya prathamāntatvamasaṃbhavyeva āsīdidaṃ tamobhūtamiti 
<l3.> pūrvaślokena māyārūpeṇa jagavasthānaṃ pratipadyānantaraṃ tata(taḥ) svayambhūriti ślokena prādurbhūtatvenocyamānasvarūpasya pūrvasiddhatamo'dhiṣṭhātṛtvāsaṃbhave'pi vāyo sāpītyanantara
<l4.>ślokasyāsaṅgatyāpatteśca sa hi ślokaḥ atīndriyagrāhyatvādidharmaviśiṣṭāt parameśvarāt prakṛtasya svayambhuvo bhedavyavacchedaparaḥ na tu svayaṃ ha pitṛtvādividhiparaḥ evakāro
<l5.>pahatavidhiśaktikatvāt ata evāśvasya catusṛṅgatvaṃ vacanādvaiṣikamiti navamādhyāyacaturthapādādhikaraṇe ṣaḍviṃśati rītyeva brūyādityevakāreṇa vidhiśaktervihitena vidhitvamityu
<l6.>ktaṃ prakṛte'pi svayamudbabhāvityaṃśasya tata(taḥ) svayambhuriti pūrvaślokapratipāditasvayaṃ bhavitṛtvadharmānuvādatvasaṃbhavācca tathā ca tvatpakṣe nikhilaprapañcaprakṛti
<l7.>bhūtā vidyākhyatamo'dhiṣṭhātṛparasya tamo nuda ityasya prathamāntatvamaṅgīkṛtya svayambhuviśeṣaṇatve tasya parameśvarāt bhedaprasaktireva na prasarati na vā bhedavyavaccheda
<l8.>pratipādanasyeha saṅgatirasti kācit matpakṣe tu tamo'dhiṣṭhātuḥ parameśvarāt svayambhuvaḥ prādurbhāvoktyā tato bhedaprasaktirasti prādurbhavituḥ śivatve tatra svayaṃ 
<l9.> bhūtvānupapattiḥ īśvaratve anekeśvaravādaḥ prasajyateti śākā nirākaraṇāya bhedavyavacchedo'pi pratipādanīya ityāsīdidaṃ tamobhūtamiti prapūrvaślokapratipā
<l10.>ditā tamo'dhiṣṭhātā parameśvara eva upādhiviśeṣakṛtanārāyaṇamūrtyātmanā sargādāvabhivyakta iti tata(taḥ) svayambhuriti pūrvaślokena pratipāditaḥ| nānya ityetadabhiprāyako yo'sāvityādiḥ 
<l11.> saṅgacchate| tasmāttanmo nuda iti etat kvibantaṃ pañcamyantaṃ satprādurbhāvayitra(tṛ)parameva kiṃ ca ātmana ākāśaḥ saṃbhūta ityādisṛṣṭivākyārthaparyālocanāyām ākāśādyabhimānināṃ sadā 
<l12.> gacchate tasmāt tamo nuditi etat kvibantaṃ pañcamyantaṃ sat prādurbhavayitra(tṛ)paraśiveśvararudraviṣṇubrahmaṇāṃ pūrvapūrvasmāduttarottarotpatte(-)ravagamasyottaratropapā
<l13.>dayiṣyamāṇatvāt manusmṛtyupakrame'pi tamo nudo rudrādviṣṇuḥ prādurāsīdityevārthaḥ ucitaḥ āśrayituṃ tathā ca so'bhidhyāyetyatra tacchabdena pūrvoktayuktyā prādurbhavayi
<l14.>tṛrudrasyaiva grahaṇāt aptatvasya rudrasṛjyatvaṃ siddhaṃ nanvevamapi nārāyaṇasyā(ya) rudrasṛṣṭāptatvāyatanatve'pi rudrādutpa

<p30b., F28a., l1.>ttiḥ kathaṃ nārāyaṇāsamākhyābalena labhyata iti cenna naraśabdavācyaśivasṛṣṭā(-)ptatvāyatanatvalakṣaṇapravṛttinimittaśālyanārāyaṇasamākhyārthaparyālocanāyām aptatvasya śivasṛjyatvāvagame siddhe tatra 
<l2.> sṛjyatāvacchedakajñānaṃ vinā sṛjyatājñānasaṃbhavāt tatsṛjyatāvacchedakagaveṣaṇāyāṃ tatsṛjyatābodhakapramāṇe apa eva sasarjetyādivacane tanmūlabhūtasādhiṣṭhātṛbhūtavācyākāśādipadaghaṭita ātmana ākāśaḥ 
<l3.> saṃbhūta ityāditaittarīyādiśrutyanusāreṇāpśabdasya nārāyaṇādhiṣṭhitāptvāvacchinna(-)bodhakatayā nārāyaṇādhiṣṭhitāptvameva śivasṛjyatāvacchedakamiti viśiṣṭe ucyamānāyāḥ sṛjyatāyā bādhābhāve'pi 
<l4.> viśeṣaṇe'pi saṃbhavena nārāyaṇe'pi śivasṛjyatvaṃ nārāyaṇapadenaiva bodhyate na ca mūlabhūta(-)taittarīyaśrutau ākāśādipadasya sādhiṣṭhātṛkabhūtabodhakatvamasiddhamiti vācyaṃ tatra tadabhimāni devatāviśiṣṭasyaiva 
<l5.> uttarottarasya bhūtasya pūrvapūrvasmāttattadabhimānidevatāviśiṣṭāt bhūtāt utpatteravaśyavaktavyatvena tadanurodhena ākāśādipadasya sādhiṣṭhātṛkabhūtabodhakatvasyāvaśyamaṅgīkaraṇīyatvāt 
<l6.> tathā hi yadyapyātmana ākāśa ityādiśrutāvākāśādibhūtānyeva śrutāni na tu tattadabhimānidevatāḥ tathāpi samānaprakaraṇe chāndogyagatasṛṣṭivākye tatteja aikṣa tatā āpa aikṣanteti kṣaṇaṃ 
<l7.> śrutaṃ tattāvadīkṣaṇamacetanakartṛkaṃ na saṃbhavatīti tatra teja ādipadānāṃ tattadabhimānidevatāparatvamavaśyaṃ vaktavyam| tathā ca taittarīyaśrutigatā(-)kāśādipadānāmapi chāndogyagatasṛṣṭivākyopasaṃhā
<l8.>rānurodhena tattadabhimānidevatāviśiṣṭākāśādiparatvaṃ vaktavyameva nanvevamapi chāndogye tadaikṣata bahu syāṃ prajā ye yeti brahmaṇo bahubhavanasaṅkalpasya prathamaṃ śrutatvena tatteja 
<l9.> aikṣatetyādināpi tasyaiva prapañcā kriyate na tu teja ādibhūtā mahimāni devatākartṛkamīkṣamāṇāntaramucyate anyathā prathamaśrutabahubhavanasaṅkalpasya tejaḥ sṛṣṭimātraviṣayatvena 
<l10.> saṅkocāpatteḥ tathā cākāśādipadānāṃ tattadantaryāmi brahmaparatvameva na tu tattadabhimānidevatāparatvaṃ na ca nityasya brahmaṇaḥ kathamākāśādikrameṇotpattiriti vācyaṃ mṛdādivat 
<l11.> svarūpānyathābhāvalakṣaṇāyā utpatterayoge'pi svaviśeṣaṇabhūtadharmānyathābhāvalakṣaṇāyāstasyānitye'pi brahmaṇi saṃbhavādata evaitā kālaṃ caitraḥ pācako'bhūt 
<l12.> adhunā yājaka utpanna ityādiprayogo dṛśyata iti cenna evamapyākāśādi(-)padasyākāśādyabhimāni tattaddevatāviśiṣṭaparatvasyāpi sadāśivādīnāṃ pūrvapūrva samāduttarottara
<l13.>sṛṣṭipratipādakarudrasaṃjñakasyetyādipurāṇavacanā rodhenāvaśyavaktavyatvāttathā cākāśādipadānāmākāśā(-)dyabhimānitattadvetāviśiṣṭākāśādiviśiṣṭāntaryāmamiparatva
<l14.>meva tathā viśiṣṭe varṇyamānaḥ kāryakāraṇabhāvaḥ bādhakābhāvāt sādhakatvācca viśeṣaṇeṣvapi sadāśivādiṣvavataratyeva na caivaṃ vāyvādipadārthā(-)nāmākāśādyabhimāni tattadantaryāmi ubhaya
<l15.>sṛjyatvāpattiriti vācyaṃ ghaṭādeḥ sākṣāt paramparayā ca kulāleśvarobhayasṛjyatvavadatrāpyubhayasṛjyatvāpatteriṣṭatvāt  na caivamapi rudrasaṃjñasyetyādipurāṇavacane ākāśa
<l16.>vāyupadārthayorutpattirna śrūyata eva kiṃ ca agnitoyābhimāni rudraviṣṇubhyāṃ toyapṛthivyabhimāni viṣṇubrahmaṇorutpattirapi sphuṭāntaraṃ na pratīyate tathā ca kathameta
<l17.>dvacanānusāreṇa taittarīyaśrutigatākāśādipadānāṃ tattadabhimānidevatāviśiṣṭaparamiti vācyaṃ chāndogyasṛṣṭivākye tejaḥ prāthamyaśravaṇe'pi taittarīyaśrutyanu
<l18.>sāreṇākāśavāyusṛṣṭyupasaṃhāravadaṇḍaṃ hiraṇmayamiti śrutau tanmūlarudrasaṃjñasyetyādipurāṇavacane ca taittarīyaśrutyanusāreṇaivākāśavāyu

<p31a., F28b., l1.>sṛṣṭyupasaṃhārasyāvaśyavaktavyatvānnādyo doṣaḥ nāpi dvitīyaḥ tathā hi rudrasaṃjñasyetyādi arthasyāyamarthaḥ rudrasaṃjñasya devasya mūrtiḥ rudrādhiṣṭhātṛkatejomūrtyantaryāmirūpe rūpāt 
<l2.> cā(chā)ndaso vibhaktivyatyayaḥ vāyupadārthasvarūpāt prajāyata iti tejo mūrtyabhimāninā tena rudreṇa jale vīryaṃ kṣiptamiti tenetyarthasyārthaḥ tathā ca jalamūrtau rudrakamṛkavīryakṣepavarṇane 
<l3.> nānutpannasya vīryakṣepādhikaraṇatvānyathānupapatyā viṣva(śvā)dhiṣṭhātṛkajalamūrtyantaryāmi tejaḥ padārtha utpanna ityavagamyate jale pṛthivyutpādanasāmarthyādhāyakavīryakṣeptṛtvaṃ 
<l4.> yasya tasyaiva jalasraṣṭṛtvau cityāt etena jalatatvotpattiratra na śrūyate| tat kalpane'pi rudram eva tat sṛṣṭetyatra pramāṇābhāva iti śaṅkā parāstā| tataśca tadvīryaṃ brahmādhiṣṭhā
<l5.>tṛkabrahmāṇḍātmakapṛthivī mūrtyantaryāmirūpeṇa pariṇatamiti daṇḍamabhavaddhaimamityarthasyārthaḥ| kathamacetanasya vīryasya cetanānadhiṣṭhitasya brahmāṇḍātmanā pariṇāma iti śaṅkā nirā
<l6.>karaṇārthaṃ rudrakṣiptaṃ vīryaṃ brahmāṇḍātmanā pariṇāmayituṃ hiraṇyagarbhaṃ ca sraṣṭuṃ rudraśaktivilāsādeva viṣṇurjalatvaṃ prāviśaditi viṣṇustatprāviśadityarthasyārthaḥ tathā ca viṣṇva
<l7.>bhimānikajalamūrtyantaryāmiṇo brahmābhimānikapṛthivyantaryāmyutpanna iti siddharudrānugraha(-)labdhajalatatvapraveśalakṣaṇapravṛttinimittaśālini nārāyaṇasamākhyeti 
<l8.> punarnārāyaṇākhyāmityarthenoktam etadevemaṃ cetyādiślokadvayena prapañcitaṃ tato viṣṇvanugrahāddevamanuṣyādiprapañcajālaṃ sraṣṭuṃ brahmaṇo pṛthivītatvapraveśe 
<l9.> brahmāpītyarthenoktaḥ tathā ca rudrasaṃjñasyetyādivacane rudraviṣṇubhyāṃ viṣṇurutpattisphuṭaraiva pratīyate na caivamapyātmana ākāśa ityāditaittarīyaśrutau rudrasaṃjñasye
<l10.>tyādipurāṇavacane tattadabhimānidevatāviśiṣṭatattadbhūtāntaryāmiṇa evoktarītyā kāryakāraṇabhāva upalabhyate na tu uttarottaratadabhimānidevatānāṃ pūrvapūrva
<l11.>devatāsṛjyatvamiti vācyaṃ viśiṣṭe ucyamānasya kāryakāraṇabhāvyāsati bādhake viśeṣaṇe'pi paryavasānamityuktatvāt kiṃ ca tattadabhimānidevatāviśiṣṭatattadbhūtāntaryāmiṇa evoktaṃ 
<l12.> utpattiḥ na svarūpānyathābhāvaḥ kiṃ tu svaviśeṣaṇībhūtadharmānyathābhāva ityuktaṃ sa ca svakīya(-)śarīrānyathābhāva evātra paryavasitaḥ anyādṛśasyāsaṃbhavāt saṃbhave'pi vā vinigamanāviraheṇa (.......)rīṇyānya
<l13.>thābhāvasyāpi grahītumucitatvāt sadāśivāditattadabhimānidevatāścāntaryāmiṇaḥ paramaśivasya śarīrarūpā eva vigrahaṃ devadevasya jagadetaccarācaram| etamarthaṃ na jānanti paśavaḥ pāśagaura
<l14.>vāt vidyeti cetanaṃ prāhuḥ tathā vidyācetanām| vidyāvidyātmakaṃ sarvaṃ viśvaṃ viśvagurorvibhoḥ sarūpamasya na sandeho viśvaṃ tasya vaśe yataḥ| 

saccāsacca jagatsarvaṃ śarīraṃ parameṣṭhinaḥ| 
vṛkṣasya (*)mūlasekena śākhāḥ puṣyanti vai yathā||(*) 
<l15.>
śivasya pūjayā tadvat puṣyatyasya vapurjagat| 
ātmā tasyāṣṭamī mūrtiḥ śivasya paramātmanaḥ|| 
vyāpiketanamūrtīnāṃ viśvaṃ tasmācchivātmakam|

        ityādi
<l16.>purāṇavacanaiḥ cidacidātmakasya sarvasyāpi prapañcasya paramaśivaśarīratvapratipādanānna cākāśādibhūtātmakaśarīrānyathābhāvamādāyaiva tadantaryāmiṇaḥ paramaśivasyotpattau 

<p31b., F29a., l1.> saṃbhavantyāṃ tattadabhimānidevatātmakaśarīrānyathābhāvopyutpattitve'nukalpanīya iti vācyaṃ vinigamanāvirahāt rudrasaṃjñasyetyāditattadabhimānidevatāvācakapadopādānasvārasyāttattadabhimānidevatā(-)tmakaśarī
<l2.>rānyathābhāvasyāpyuktitvena grāhyatvāt anyathā rudrasaṃjñasya devasya mūrtiriti vihāya tejaḥ prajāyata etyeva brūyāt vastutastu rudrayāmale spaṣṭameva pūrvapūrvabhūtābhimānidevatābhya uttarottarabhūtābhimāni(-)devatā
<l3.>nāmutpatti(ttiḥ) samarthyate tatha(thā) hi| 

asti nāsti dvayātīto vāṅmanogocarātmakaḥ| 
avarṇo varṇasaṃyukto virūpo viśvarūpadhṛk|| 
paramātmā parandhāma kaściddevo'sti tacchivaḥ| 
śiva(vā)dutpadyate śaktiḥ (*)śāntyatītakalātmikā||(*) 
<l4.> 
ādau vyomni sthitābhāti sākṣāddevaḥ sadāśivaḥ| 
sadāśivādīśvaro'pi vāyutatve vyavasthitaḥ||
īśvarādabhavadrudraḥ vāhau(yau) sthitvā pratāpavān|
rudrādviṣṇurmahātejāḥ vāritatve vyavasthitaḥ|| 
<l5.>
viṣṇorbrahmā samutpannaḥ pṛthivyāṃ samavasthitaḥ|

        tasmāttattadbhūtāmāni devatānāmapi pūrvapūrvābhimānidevatābhya utpattiḥ siddhaiva etadvacanajātaikārthyāya manusmṛtyu
<l6.>pakrame'pi tata(taḥ) svayambhuriti ślokena tamo rudrābhimānikatejontaryāmiṇaḥ viṣṇvabhimānikatoyāntaryāmyutpattirahitā so'bhidhyāyeti ślokena sa iti tacchabdena tamo nuda
<l7.>mavaparāmṛśya tatkartṛkavīryakṣepo jalatatve nihitaḥ| atrāptatvasṛṣṭiśravaṇaṃ tu pūrvaślokaviṣṇūtpattivarṇanena tadadhiṣṭhitāptatva(-)sṛṣṭerapyuktatvenānuvādaḥ| tato viṣṇo
<l8.>raptatvapraveśo'nukto'pi viṣṇustat prāviśaditi purāṇāntaravacanānusāreṇa kalpanīyastato brahmādhiṣṭhitapṛthivyantaryāmyutpattistadaṇḍamabhavaddhaimamiti 
<l9.> ślokenoktā atrāpi ākāśavāyusṛṣṭistaittarīyaśrutyanurodhena upasaṃhartavyā tato āpo nārā iti ślokena viṣṇo rudrānugrahalabdhanārā
<l10.>yaṇasamākhyāpravṛttinimittaṃ jalatatvapraveśalakṣaṇaṃ varṇitam| tathā cāpa eva sasarjetyatrāpśabdasya nārāyaṇādhiṣṭhitāptatvavācakatvasya siddhatvena rudrasṛjyatāvacchedakaṃ nārāya
<l11.>ṇā dhiṣṭhitāptatvameveti viśeṣaṇībhūtanārāyaṇasyāpi rudrasṛjyatvaṃ siddhaṃ na caivamapyākāśādibhūta(-)pañcakasya sadāśiveśvararudraviṣṇubrahmāṇo'dhiṣṭhitāro ityatra na pramā
<l12.>ṇamiti vācyaṃ sadāśiveśvarau rudro viṣṇurbrahmā ca suvratāḥ ete tu pañcabhūtānāṃ devatā upari kīrtitāḥ| iti sūtasaṃhitāyāṃ yajñavaibhava(-)khaṇḍāntargatavacanasya sadāśivaḥ śabdamū
<l13.>rtiratheśvaraḥ| 

rudrastejomayaḥ sākṣāt rasamūrtirjanārdanaḥ| 
gandhamūrtiścaturvaktra ityete pañcamūrtayaḥ||

        iti nīlakaṇṭhabhāṣyodāhṛtapurāṇavacanasya ca tatra pramāṇatvāt nanvevamapi uktarītyā nārā
<l14.>yaṇasamākhyā balena saṃhārarudrasyaiva nārāyaṇasraṣṭṛtvamavagatam| na tu paramaśivasya tamomātrāvaśeṣakāla(-)vṛttimūlakāraṇatvena tvadabhimatasya tathā ca divyo devā eko nārāyaṇa iti 
<l15.> subālopaniṣadānmātasya nārāyaṇaśabdasya tamomātrāvaśeṣakālavṛttimūlakāraṇavācakasya kathaṃ paramaśive pravṛttirupapadyata ityāha| nārāyaṇārthapariśodhanamānavasmṛtyudghoṣitā 
<l16.> harijanirguṇarudrata(taḥ) syāt| na tvatta ityabhidadhāti girīśa| mūḍhaḥ kaścittu tasya tava cāpyabhidhāmabudhvā (.....) taptāyaḥ piṇḍavadviprāḥ mūrtiḥ paraśivasya tu mūrtyā tulyānya
<l17.>mūrtibhyo lakṣaṇairmunivattamāḥ|
 
paratatvasya nāmāni pratyāsatyā munīśvarāḥ| 
trimūrtīnāṃ tu rudrasyāpyabhidhānāni suvratāḥ||
 
        ityādisūtasaṃhitāvacanena| saṃhārarudramāhātmyaṃ 
<l18.> prastutya (-)

sa eṣa bhagavānīśastejo rāśiranāmayaḥ| 
tvanādinidhano dhātā bhūtasaṅkocako vibhuḥ|| 
paramaiśvaryasaṃyuktaḥ parameśvarabhāvitaḥ| 
tacchaktyadhiṣṭhitaḥ śaśvat tacci(cchi)hnerapi cihnitaḥ|| 

        tannāmā 

<p32a., F29b., l1.> tadrūpastatkāryakaraṇamaḥ| tatkalyavyavahāraśca tadājñāparipālaka ityādiśivapurāṇavacane ca paramaśivasaṃhārarudrayoḥ samānanāmarūpacaritatvāvagamena saṃhārarudravat paramaśivasyāpi nārāyaṇasamākhyābalena 
<l2.> nārāyaṇasraṣṭṛtvasyāvagantuṃ śakyatvāt tasmānnaraśabdavāci śivasṛṣṭāptatvāyatanatvalakṣaṇapravṛttinimittaśāli nārāyaṇasamākhyābalenāpi paramaśivasya nārāyaṇa(-)sraṣṭṛtvamakṣuṇṇamevāvagamyate| nanvevamapi prācīneṣu 
<l3.> sakalavyākaraṇagrantheṣu pūrvapadāditi sūtrasya vidhyarthatve rāmanāmādiśabdeṣu ṇatvaprasaktireva nāsti niyamārthatve aṭkupvāṅitisūtraprasaktaṃ niyamena vāryata iti ghaṇṭāghoṣo'dhunā gaganakusumāyamāna(naḥ) syāt 
<l4.> yuṣmatpakṣe kṣubhnādipāṭhenaiva tatra ṇatvasya vāraṇīyatvādityata āha| asmatpraṇītasaraṇau vrajatāṃ na pūrvairvyākartṛbhiḥ sati virodha udeti doṣaḥ| yatte parasparavirodhakarālacittābhṛteśaśiṣṭaca
<l5.>ritaṃ hi mahatpramāṇam| bhavatvevameva prācīnagranthakāraireva prakriyākaumudī, manoramā, svarasiddhāntacandrikākārādibhiḥ pūrvapūrvān dūṣayadbhiḥ uttarottaraiḥ pramādasya puruṣadharmatvamiti nyāyasya spaṣṭīkara
<l6.>ṇāt ata eva vaiyākaraṇānāmapi tatra tatra mahāntaḥ pramādā dṛśyante tatra diṅmātramasmābhiḥ pradṛśyate tathā hi yuvan(-)śabdāt śasi śvayuvamaghonāmataddhita iti vasya saṃprasāraṇe pūrvarūpe savarṇadīrghe ca 
<l7.> kṛte yakārasya punaḥ samprasāraṇe prāptena samprasāraṇe samprasāraṇamiti samprasāraṇaparatayā tasminniṣedhe rutvavisargayoḥ yūna iti rūpamiti sarvavyākaraṇagranthoktā prakriyā saiṣā 
<l8.> gaganakamalinīkalpevābhāti tathā hi yūna ityasya na samprasāraṇa ityasya prasaktireva na saṃbhavati samprasāraṇasya pūrvarūpasavarṇadīrghābhyāmapahārāt na ca pūrvarūpasyāntavat bhāvena savarṇadīrghasyādivat 
<l9.> bhāvena ca samprasāraṇagrahaṇena grahaṇānta(nna)samprasāra ityasti prasaktiriti vācyaṃ varṇāśrayentādivat bhāvaniṣedhasya ṣatvatukorasiddha iti kṛtyasiddhatvavacanena jñāpitatvāt anyathā dhītyetyādau 
<l10.> savarṇadīrghasyādivat bhāvena hrasvatvāt hrasvasyāpītīti tuki siddhe ekādeśasya tukyasiddhatvavacanaṃ vyarthaṃ syāt ata eva vṛkṣe uha vṛkṣe ihetyādāvāgguṇasyaikādeśasyādivat bhāvena 
<l11.> savarṇadīrgho na bhavati na caivaṃ hṛto jina ityādāvapi hventithātoḥ jyādhātoścaktapratyaye vacisvapiyajādīnāmiti grahijyeti ca samprasāraṇe pūrvarūpe ca kṛte pūrvarūpasya samprasāraṇagraha
<l12.>ṇena grahītumaśakyatvāddhala iti dīrgho na syāditi vācyaṃ hala iti sūtrārambhasāmarthyādeva samprasāraṇasthānike'pi dīrgho bhavatīti jñāpanāt na caivaṃ jñāpakasya sāmānyāpekṣatvamāśritya samprasāra
<l13.>ṇakāryaṃ sarvatatsthānike'pi bhavatītyurarīkriyata iti vācyam| evamapi yūna ityatrācaḥ parasminniti sthānivadbhāvena yakārokāreṇa vyavadhānāt samprasāraṇaparatvaṃ yakārasya na saṃbhavatyeva ata 
<l14.> eva (...............................)va varṇāśrayentādivatvapravṛttāpi na nirvāhaḥ| acaḥparasminniti sthānivatvakṛtasyāvadhānasya tadāpyanivāryatvāt ata evādeca upadeśe śitīti sūtre bhāṣyakṛdbhiḥ aṣītīti paryudā
<l15.>sapakṣe glāyanti mlāyantītyatra śabde kādeśasyādivadbhāvenātvamāśaṅkyācaḥparasminniti sthānivatvena parihṛtam| nanu hvaḥ samprasāraṇamiti sūtrāt samprasāraṇagrahaṇena vartamāne punaḥ samprasāraṇa
<l16.>grahaṇaṃ videśasthasyāpi śvayuvamaghonāmiti vihitasya pratiṣedhārthaṃ satyūna ityatra sthānivadbhāvakṛtaṃ vyavadhānaṃ na doṣāyeti jñāpayatīti cenna deśāntarasthena vyadholidīti sūtreṇa vivyadha 

<p32b., F30a., l1.> (vivyadha ṛep.?) ityādau abhyāsayakārasya prathamaṃ samprasāraṇe kṛte tadavyavahitapūrvasya vakārasya punastenaiva samprasāraṇe prāpte tanniṣedhārthatvenāpyupapannasya punaḥ smprasāraṇagrahaṇasya yūna ityatra vyava
<l2.>dhānādoṣatvajñāpakatvāyogāt nanu vyatho liṭīti samprasāraṇasya halādiśeṣāpavādatayā utsargāpavādayorekaviṣayatva(-)niyamena vakāre samprasāraṇe  prāpterevābhāvena kathaṃ tani(nni)ṣedhārthatvena 
<l3.> punaḥ samprasāraṇagrahaṇasya cāritārthamiti cenna| jātipakṣe vyatho liṭīti sūtrapravṛtyā vakārasya halādiśeṣaviṣayatvābhāvena yena nāprāptinyāyābhāvāt vyaktipakṣe prativyakti(ktiḥ) śāstrabhedāt yakāraviṣayakasya 
<l4.> ṇa ityasyāpravṛttau yakāravakārayorapyaviśeṣādvyatho liṭīti sūtrapravṛtyā vakārasya halādiśeṣaviṣayatvābhāvena yena nāprāptinyāyābhāvāt vyaktipakṣe prativyakti(ktiḥ) śāstrabhedāt yakāraviṣayakasya 
<l5.> śāstrakasya halādiśeṣāpavādatve'pi vakāraviṣayakasya tadapavādatvagandhābhāvāt ata eva kāśikāyāṃ vivyadha ityatra vakārasya na samprasāraṇa iti sūtreṇa samprasāraṇaṃ niṣiddhaṃ vyatho liṭītyasya halādiśeṣā
<l6.>pavādatve tu kāśikāvirodhaspaṣṭa eva| evaṃ ca vyatho liṭīti sūtrasya halādiśeṣāpavādatvaṃ vyathadhātau yat bhaṭṭojiyajvabhirabhāṇi tat prauḍhivādamātraṃ vyaktipakṣe yakāraviṣayakaśāstrābhiprāyaṃ 
<l7.> veti kṛtabuddhau ya eva vidāṃ kurvantu etena manoramāyāṃ sudhyupāsya ityatra samprasāraṇacceti pūrvarūpamāśaṅkya samprasāraṇapūrvatve samānāṃ grahaṇamiti vārtikena prathamaṃ samādhāya 
<l8.> samprasāraṇasthānikasyātathātvāditi kecit tanna yūna ityasiddheriti yaduktaṃ tat prauḍhivādamātramiti spaṣṭameva sūkṣmadhiyāṃ hala iti sāmānyāpekṣajñāpakamāśritya samprasāraṇasthānikasya 
<l9.> samsā(samprasā)raṇagrahaṇena grahaṇe'pi yūna ityatra sthānivadbhāvakṛtavyavadhānasya durvāratayā tadū(drū)pāsiddherapratisamādheyatvāt nanu na hi kāryanimittatvenāśrayata iti paribhāṣā
<l10.>sthaṇḍilachśayitari vrata iti nirdeśena kūṭādiṣu āṅśabdapāṭhena ca jñāpitā tathā hi ktiṅiti ceti parasaptyā

(ptamyā)śrayaṇe chinnaṃ bhinnamityādau dakārā(-)vyavadhānenekaḥ 
<l11.> ktitparatvābhāvāt guṇapratiṣedho na syāt| ato nimittasaptamītyāśrayaṇīyaṃ tathā ca śiṅo ṅitvāt tasya guṇo'bhavan ṅinnimittaka eveti kiti ceti niṣedhe śayi
<l12.>tarīti nirdeśo'nupapannaḥ eva kū(kṛ)ṅo ṅitvena tannimittakaguṇe niṣiddhe tasya kūṭādipāṭhaḥ gāṅkuṭādibhyo'ñiṇiṅaṅit iti guṇaniṣedhārthaṅitvātideśārthopyanupapa
<l13.>nnaḥ tathā caitau nirdeśapāṭhau imāṃ paribhāṣāṃ jñāpayataḥ tathā ca śīṅkuṅorguṇo na śiṅkuṅnimittaka iti nirdeśapāṭhāvupapannau prayojanaṃ cāsyāḥ paribhāṣāyāścyavate 
<l14.> plavata ityādikaṃ tathā ca yūna ityatra savarṇadīrghasyobhayasthānikatvena paranimitta(-)tvābhāvena sthānivatvameva nāvakāśaṃ labhata iti cenna na hi kāryīti paribhāṣāyā niṣprayojanatvenānaṅgīkā
<l15.>rāt na ca cyavata ityādikaṃ prayojanamiti vācyam| tasyānyathāsiddhatvāttathā tathā hi kadatīti parasaptamyeva tathā ca cyavata ityādau guṇaḥ siddhaḥ na ca vācyaṃ bhinnaṃ bhinnamityādau dakāreṇa 
<l16.> vyavadhānānniṣedho na syāditi kṣnoḥ kitkaraṇena ekavarṇavyavadhāne'pi guṇaniṣedho bhaviṣyatīti jñāpanānnanu na hi kāryīti paribhāṣānaṅgīkāre aririṣatīti rūpaṃ na sidhyet 

<p33a., F30b., l1.> tathā hi ṛdhātoḥ sani smin pūṅrañjaśāṃsanīti ṭiguṇe ca aris iti sthite ajāditvena sanyaṅoriti ris śabdasya citve halādiśeṣe ca aririṣatīti rūpaṃ tatra paribhāṣānaṅgīkāre dvitvaṃ prati kāryiṇa ikārasya nimittatve 
<l2.> na dvirvacane'cīti rūpātideśena śiti guṇasya ṛkārarūpāpattau is(-)śabdasya dvitve arīṣatīti syāt paribhāṣāṅgīkāre tu ikārasya citvanimittatvābhāvena dvirvacane'cīti sūtrapravṛtyā 
<l3.> iṣṭarūpasiddhiriti cenna dvirvacane'cīti sūtre tantrāvṛtyādyanyatamāśrayaṇena dvitvanimitte'ci parataḥ ajādeśasthānivatsyāt dvitve kartavye ityartho varṇanīyaḥ anyathā cakrakarityādau dvitve kṛte uttarakhaṇḍasyaṃ yaṇādikaṃ na syāt kiṃ tu prakṛtibhāva eva syāt tathā ca kasyacidvitve kartavye (dvitve kartavye ṛep.) ityapekṣāyāṃ sannidhānādaca iti vā ādeśasyeti vā vaktavyaṃ tathā ca ariri
<l4.>ṣatītyatra nīkārasya vā tadādeśasya guṇasya vā tadvitvamajāditvena dvitīyaikā ca eva dvitvapravṛtte tathā ca ‘na dvirvacane'cī’ti sūtrapravṛttiḥ cakraturityādau tu ekāc dvirvacananyāyena ṛkārasyāpi dvitvabhāktvāt 
<l5.> sūtrapravṛttiḥ tathā ca paribhāṣāṃ vinaivāririṣatītyādirūpasiddheḥ sā nāṅgīkāryā pratyuta paribhāṣāṅgīkāre doṣo'pi dṛśyate tathā hi śrāyasau gautamau caturau anaḍuhau ityādau ekādeśasya 
<l6.> parādivadbhāvena numāmau prāpnutaḥ| acaḥ parasminniti sthānivadbhāvakṛtavyavadhānena vāraṇīyau paribhāṣāṅgīkāre ca sthānivadbhāvasyaiva tatrāprasakteḥ evaṃ ca dīdhīvevīṭāmiti sūtrakaustubhana 
<l7.> kāryīti paribhāṣāṃ jñāpakaprayojanavarṇanapurassaramupapādyācaḥ parasminniti sūtrakaustubhe śrāyasau gautamau ityādau sthānivadbhāvakṛtavyavadhānena numāmau 
<l8.> pariharatām| bhaṭṭojiyajvanāṃ kathaṃ na pūrvāparavirodha iti jñeyaṃ tasmādyūna ityādau na samprasāraṇa ityasyāpravṛttirevāta eva na samprasāraṇa iti sūtre bhāṣye 
<l9.> punaḥ samprasāraṇagrahaṇaṃ yūna ityatra videśasthena śvayuvamaghonāmiti sūtreṇa prāptasyāpi samprasāraṇasya pratiṣedhārthamityuktvā ucyamānepyetasmin na sidhyatītyā
<l10.>dinā uktarītyā taddūṣitam| tasmādyūna iti rūpasiddhaye yatnāntaramāstheyaṃ tathā hi na samprasāraṇa iti sūtrasya samprasāraṇe pare na samprasāraṇa iti nārthaḥ kiṃ tu 
<l11.> ekasminaṅge samprasāraṇe sakṛt gate punarna samprasāraṇa ityarthaḥ ata eva na samprasāraṇe samprasāraṇamiti sūtre bhāṣyakārāḥ yūna iti rūpāsiddhimuktarītyā āśaṅkya samānāṅgagrahaṇaṃ karta
<l12.>vyamiti vārtikamavatāryaitadabhiprāyeṇa samādadhuḥ| ata eva dvirvacane'cīti sūtre acaḥ parasminniti sūtrādanuvartamānasyāca iti ṣaṣṭhyantasyābhāve asūṣupadityādau svāpeśca 
<l13.> ṅiti samprasāraṇamapi niṣiddhe tataścābhyāse uvarṇo na śrūyatetyuktvā dvitvāt pūrvaṃ samprasāraṇe niṣiddhe'pi dvitve kṛte punarabhyāse samprasāraṇamastvityāśaṅkya na 
<l14.> samprasāraṇe samprasāraṇamiti parihṛtaṃ kaustubha(-)manoramayoḥ tatra ca samprasāraṇe kṛte na samprasāraṇa ityarthe tātparyamavaśyaṃ 
<l15.> salpyam| samprasāraṇe pare na samprasāraṇamityasya vyavadhānenāsambhavāt na caivamupoṣuṣaḥ upeṣuṣetyādau ekasminaṅge vacisvapī(-)

<p33b., F31a., l1.>tyādinā vasidhātuvakārasya vasoḥ samprasāraṇamiti vasipratyayavakārasya ca samprasāraṇadvayaṃ na syāditi vācyam| akasminaṅge ityanena yaṃ pratyayaṃ nittīkṛtya pūrvasamprasāraṇaṃ kṛtaṃ tameva nimittīkṛtya punaḥ samprasāraṇaṃ na bhavatī
<l2.>ti vivakṣitatvāt upoṣuṣa ityādau ca dhātuvakārasya samprasāraṇaṃ kva supratyayanimittakaṃ vasu vakārasya tu śaśādipratyayanimittakamityadoṣaḥ| na caivamapi yūna ityādau prathamameva yakārasya samprasāraṇaṃ syāt 
<l3.> parasyaiva yaṇaḥ prathamaṃ samprasāraṇamityetat jñāpakasya samprasāraṇe pare na samprasāraṇamityarthasya tvayānaṅgīkārāditi vācyaṃ yūnastiḥ, vṛddho yūnā, yūni lugityādinirdeśāt jñāpakāt asmatpakṣe'pi pratha
<l4.>maṃ parasyaiva yaṇaḥ samprasāraṇamiti vaktuṃ śakyatvāt na cāsmatpakṣe'pi yūna ityādinirdeśa sāmarthyādeva vyavadhānaṃ na doṣāvahamiti vācyam| evaṃ sati yūna ityādinirdeśa(-)sāmarthyādeva yakārasya na samprasāraṇami
<l5.>ti vaktumaśakyatvena vyavadhānasyādoṣatvajñāpanadvārā na samprasāraṇa iti sūtrasthapravṛtyupapādanasya gauravaparāhatatvāt niṣphalatvācca manmate tu nirdeśasāmarthyāt prathamaṃ parasya samprasāraṇena samprasā
<l6.>raṇa iti sūtreṇa yakārasya na samprasāraṇamiti viśeṣaḥ| vastutastu antyabādhe'ntyasandeśasyeti nyāyamūlaparibhāṣayā yūna ityādau prathamaṃ parasya yaṇaḥ samprasāraṇaḥ sidhyati na caitat 
<l7.> paribhāṣāṅgīkāre na samprasāraṇa iti sūtraṃ vyarthamiti vācyam iṣṭāpatteḥ ata eva ṣyaṅaḥ samprasāraṇamiti sūtrabhāṣyakṛdbhirna samprasāraṇa iti sūtrapraṇayanalāghavamevaitat 
<l8.> paribhāṣā prādhamikaprayojanatvena parigaṇitaṃ na caitat paribhāṣāṅgīkāre tadoḥ saḥ sāviti sūtraṃ tad saḥ ityādādeva vapravartete takārasyāntyasadeśatvāt kyad sya ityādau tu na 
<l9.> pravarteta takārasyāntasya sadeśatvābhāvādityādidoṣāṇāṃ ṣyaṅaḥ samprasāraṇasūtrabhāṣya evodāhṛtatvāt kathametaditi vācyam| etat bhāṣyasya pūrvapakṣarūpatvāt ata eva tatsūtro
<l10.>pasaṃhārabhāṣye na hi bhikṣukāḥ santīti sthālyo nādhīśriyanta ityupakramya tasmādyānyetasyāḥ paribhāṣāyāḥ prayojanāni tadarthameṣā paribhāṣā kartavyā pratividheyaṃ doṣeṣvityu
<l11.>ktvodāttanirdeśāt siddhamityādinā yat sūtre paribhāṣāpravṛttirabhimatā tatra adaso serityādau udāttanirdeśaḥ kartavyaḥ| yatra nābhimatā tatra tadoḥ saḥ sāvityādau udāttanirdeśo na kartavya iti 
<l12.> doṣāḥ parihṛtāḥ| tathā caitat paribhāṣayaiva yūna ityādisiddhiḥ| tasmāt samprasāraṇe pare na samprasāraṇamityarthamāśritya yūna ityādirūpasādhanamākhaṇḍalagurorapyaśakyameva evamanye'pi 
<l13.> pramādāḥ tatra tatra bahulamupalabhyante vistarabhayāduparamyate| tasmānnārāyaṇaśabdasya paramaśive yogakālitve'pi ṇatvaṃ susādhyameva| nanvevamapi viṣṇuvācakānāṃ śabdānāṃ maheśvararū
<l14.>pamaheśvaravācakānāmapi śabdānāṃ viṣṇvāvapi yaugikatvasya sutarāṃ vivarṇayituṃ śakyatvāt eko ha vai nārāyaṇa āsīdityādyupa(-)niṣadvākyairviṣṇorapi jagatkartṛtvapratipādanācca 
<l15.> śiva eva jagatkartṛtvena sarvotkṛṣṭa iti khaṇṭāghoṣaḥ kathaṃ saṅgacchata iti cenna eko ha vai nārāyaṇa āsīdityādyupaniṣadvākyairyathā viṣṇorjagatkartṛtvaṃ pratipādyate tathā 

<p34a., F31b., l1.> sarvamidaṃ brahmaviṣṇuridrendrāste saṃprasūyanta ityātharvaśikhādyupaniṣannikurambena paramaśivasya jagatkartṛtvaṃ pratipādyate tathā copaniṣadāṃ parasparavirodhe pūrve padaśa
<l2.>tarītyā yadātama iti kṛtsnamantravaiyarthyaparihārāyādharvaśikhādyanurodhena nārāyaṇotkarṣapratipādakānāmupaniṣadāṃ puruṣasūktabhagavadgītādeśca paramaśivotkarṣa
<l3.>pratipādanaparame varṇanīyam| varṇitaṃ ca tathaiva sakalaśrutismṛtipurāṇādyāśayasārāsārakṣīranīravivecanarājahaṃsāyamānairappayadīkṣitasārvabhaumaiḥ śivatatvavivekādiṣu bahu
<l4.>grantheṣu mahatāprapañcena iti na tatrāsmābhirvyāpriyata iti sarvaṃ samañjasam| idānīṃ nārāyaṇapadabhūṣaṇatatvamālāṃ paraśivapādāravindayorarpayati|| 

etāṃ vasantatilakāmṛtatatvamālāṃ (*)nārāyaṇīyapadabhūṣaṇamarpayāmi| (*) 
<l5.>
śambho navāṅghriyugale śiśunirmitasṛkavyatyastavinyasanavatyapi tuṣṭidāhi|| 
nārāyaṇapadabhūṣaṇarūpāsau tatvamālikā śambhoḥ| 
śeṣādriṇā (*)viracitā jīyyādā candratārakādityam|| (*) 
<l6.>

        hariḥ om| rāmasvāmimakhībhūtāvakam| coleśāṇavo vādināṃ vāṅmudrākaraṇe vanidrakaraṇā bhānti trilokyāṃ sadā| pārāvārapayaḥ kaṇāḥ 
<l7.> saliladairāmucyamānā yathā loke sindhunadījalāśaya iti khyātāstava chātravāḥ| śeṣādrimukhyavibudhādhipapīyyamānaleśānyapi pravitatāni vaco'mṛtāni| 
<l8.> rājanti rāmamakhirājakīyanti veti jānanti ke budhavarāḥ bhuvanatrayeṣu ye ke ca tāvakamukhābjamarandaleśān pītvāpi vādi jayavāṅmukhabhājanāste| bhakṣyādi
<l9.>leśarahitāvapi kiṃ punasvadbhaktyā lasat suhṛdayāḥ kimu na bhavanti|| śuddhāntaraṅgāḥ kuhanā parā vā śiṣyā bhavatto yadi sarvavidyāḥ| adhīyate te'pi 
<l10.> budhottamā syurityatra śeṣādrirudāhṛtaṃ naḥ| amārgato mārgata eva vā ya upāsate śambhumatho kṛpāluṃ te bhuktimuktinitarāṃ labhanete devāsurānatra vadanti 
<l11.> santaḥ| teṣāṃ rāmaṃ makhīndrāṇāṃ caraṇāmburiha dvaye| mānasaṃ māmakaṃ nityaṃ bhṛṅgībhūya ramatvalam| śrīsāmbāya parabrahmaṇe namaḥ| 
<l12.> śrī guhacaraṇāravindābhyāṃ namaḥ| kuśalavapuropagrāmārpaharākhyapuravāsināruṇācalaguruṇā vyalekhīyaṃ nārāyaṇatatvamālikā || 

